#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:2
msgid "Environment inventory"
msgstr "环境变量清单"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:4
msgid ""
"This page lists the configuration values Cloud Agent reads: which "
"component reads each one, its default, and where to set it. Where the "
"application default differs from the supported Compose deployment, both "
"are given."
msgstr ""
"本页列出 Cloud Agent 读取的配置项：每项由哪个组件读取、默认值是什么、在哪里设置。应用默认值与官方 Compose "
"部署不同时，两者都会写明。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:8
msgid ""
"A deployment needs no hand-written configuration. A new control plane "
"starts without a `.env` ([Settings and bootstrap configuration"
"](#settings-and-bootstrap-configuration)), and Admin → Servers → Add "
"server writes each host's configuration ([Compute "
"resources](docs/developer/operations-compute.md)). The variables below "
"are optional overrides. For local setup, start with the [developer "
"guide](docs/developer/development.md); the [release "
"contract](deploy/release/README.md) describes the packaged artifacts."
msgstr ""
"部署不需要手写配置。新的控制平面启动时没有 `.env`（见[设置与初始化配置](#settings-and-bootstrap-"
"configuration)），每台主机的配置由 Admin → Servers → Add server "
"写入（见[计算资源](docs/developer/operations-"
"compute.md)）。下面的变量都是可选的覆盖项。本地开发请从[开发者指南](docs/developer/development.md)开始；[发布约定](deploy/release/README.md)说明打包好的制品。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:16
msgid "**Keep deployment values outside this public repository.**"
msgstr "**部署用的具体值不要放进这个公开仓库。**"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:18
msgid ""
"Keep secrets in the operator's private environment or unit files, or in "
"read-only key mounts, and back them up with the data they protect. Keep "
"real identifiers, hostnames, port allocations, tunnel topology and app "
"registrations in the private deployment overlay. Public examples use "
"placeholders such as `agents.example.org`."
msgstr ""
"secret 放在运维人员私有的环境文件、unit "
"文件或只读挂载的密钥文件里，并与它们保护的数据一起备份。真实的标识、主机名、端口分配、隧道拓扑和应用注册信息放在私有的部署 overlay "
"里。公开示例一律使用 `agents.example.org` 这样的占位符。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:24
msgid "Settings and bootstrap configuration"
msgstr "设置与初始化配置"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:26
msgid "Set a value where it belongs:"
msgstr "按配置项的用途决定在哪里设置："

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:28
msgid ""
"**Admin → Settings**: application behavior, integration URLs and "
"credentials, web appearance, operational intervals, upload and skill "
"limits, task titles, and global sandbox and workspace limits."
msgstr ""
"**Admin → Settings**：应用行为、集成的 URL 与凭据、Web "
"外观、运维间隔、上传和技能限制、任务标题，以及全局的沙箱和工作区限制。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:31
msgid ""
"A server's page under **Servers**: sandbox and workspace values for that "
"server only."
msgstr "**Servers** 下某台服务器的页面：只对这台服务器生效的沙箱和工作区设置。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:33
msgid ""
"Deployment files: bootstrap configuration, which gives access to the "
"database or configures processes outside the control plane."
msgstr "部署文件：初始化配置，即访问数据库所需的配置，或控制平面之外各进程的配置。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:36
msgid ""
"Bootstrap configuration covers database access, the settings encryption "
"root (`AGENT_SETTINGS_ENCRYPTION_KEY`, or the legacy "
"`AGENT_SESSION_SECRET`), recovery access (`ADMIN_TOKEN`), host enrollment"
" and sandbox manager provisioning, networking, tunnels and listeners, "
"host isolation, image and build routing, mounted paths, and trusted "
"compute deployment profiles. The Settings page lists these names with "
"their values hidden."
msgstr ""
"初始化配置包括：数据库访问、设置加密根密钥（`AGENT_SETTINGS_ENCRYPTION_KEY`，或旧的 "
"`AGENT_SESSION_SECRET`）、恢复用的访问凭据（`ADMIN_TOKEN`）、主机注册与 sandbox manager "
"的配置、网络、隧道与监听地址、主机隔离、镜像与构建路由、挂载路径，以及可信的计算部署配置。Settings 页面会列出这些名称，但隐藏它们的值。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:43
msgid "Deployment keys"
msgstr "部署密钥"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:45
msgid ""
"A new installation has no `.env` and no keys to make up. The values the "
"stack needs before it can read a setting (`AGENT_DATABASE_URL`, "
"`AGENT_POSTGRES_PASSWORD`, `AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET` and "
"`AGENT_SETTINGS_ENCRYPTION_KEY`, or an older deployment's "
"`AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` root) live in the `agent-keys` Docker volume, one "
"file each, readable only by the user that needs it. The Compose `keys` "
"service (`cloud_agent.deployment.deployment_keys`) runs before anything "
"that needs one:"
msgstr ""
"新安装没有 "
"`.env`，也不需要你编造任何密钥。这套服务在读取设置之前就需要的几个值（`AGENT_DATABASE_URL`、`AGENT_POSTGRES_PASSWORD`、`AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`"
" 和 `AGENT_SETTINGS_ENCRYPTION_KEY`，老部署则是作为根密钥的 `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET`）保存在"
" `agent-keys` Docker 卷里，每个值一个文件，只有需要它的用户能读。Compose 的 `keys` "
"服务（`cloud_agent.deployment.deployment_keys`）会先于所有依赖这些值的服务运行："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "The value is"
msgstr "这个值"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "The `keys` service"
msgstr "`keys` 服务的处理"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Set in the environment or `.env`"
msgstr "在环境变量或 `.env` 中设置了"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Stores it. After one start you can delete the line."
msgstr "存入卷中。启动一次之后，就可以删掉这一行。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "A settings root that differs from the stored one"
msgstr "设置根密钥与已保存的不同"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Stops the start: the stored root may be the only copy of the key every "
"saved secret needs."
msgstr "停止启动：已保存的根密钥可能是所有已保存 secret 所需密钥的唯一副本。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Already stored"
msgstr "已经保存过"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Keeps it."
msgstr "保留原值。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Missing, and the bundled database volume holds no database"
msgstr "缺失，且自带的数据库卷里还没有数据库"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Generates it."
msgstr "生成一个。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Missing, with an existing database or an `AGENT_DATABASE_URL` naming "
"another database"
msgstr "缺失，但已有数据库，或 `AGENT_DATABASE_URL` 指向别的数据库"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Stops the start and names what to set. A missing settings root is only a "
"warning, because a legacy `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` may be supplied another "
"way."
msgstr "停止启动，并指出需要设置什么。缺少设置根密钥只记一条警告，因为旧的 `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` 可能通过别的方式提供。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:61
msgid ""
"Each control-plane process fills these variables from their files when "
"the environment leaves them unset, so `docker compose exec` and `docker "
"compose run` see them too; Postgres reads its password through "
"`POSTGRES_PASSWORD_FILE`. Back the keys up apart from the database "
"([Disaster recovery](docs/developer/disaster-recovery.md)). This command "
"prints them as single-quoted `.env` lines that restore them byte for byte"
" on another machine (unquoted, Compose would read a `$` as "
"interpolation):"
msgstr ""
"环境变量没有设置时，每个控制平面进程都会从对应文件读入这些值，所以 `docker compose exec` 和 `docker compose"
" run` 也能拿到它们；Postgres 则通过 `POSTGRES_PASSWORD_FILE` "
"读取密码。这些密钥要与数据库分开备份（见[灾难恢复](docs/developer/disaster-"
"recovery.md)）。下面的命令把它们输出为带单引号的 `.env` 行，在另一台机器上可以逐字节恢复（不加引号的话，Compose 会把 "
"`$` 当作变量插值）："

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:73
msgid ""
"The control plane then creates its first settings row with random "
"`AGENT_CONTROL_TOKEN_SECRET`, `AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY`, "
"`AGENT_COMPUTE_SECRET_KEY` and `AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_TOKEN` values where"
" the environment supplies none. Server setup writes that sandbox manager "
"credential into each host it deploys. An existing settings row never gets"
" generated values."
msgstr ""
"随后，控制平面创建第一行设置；环境变量没有提供的 "
"`AGENT_CONTROL_TOKEN_SECRET`、`AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY`、`AGENT_COMPUTE_SECRET_KEY`"
" 和 `AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_TOKEN`，会用随机值填上。服务器设置会把这个 sandbox manager "
"凭据写入它部署的每台主机。已有的设置行永远不会被填入生成的值。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:79
msgid "Saved settings"
msgstr "已保存的设置"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:81
msgid ""
"Saved settings live in the Agent database and stay in force across "
"restarts. A row marked *Initial import* is such a setting: its "
"environment value is imported once, and later `.env` changes are ignored."
msgstr ""
"已保存的设置存放在 Agent 数据库中，重启后依然有效。标有 *首次导入* 的行就是这类设置：它的环境变量值只导入一次，之后对 `.env` "
"的修改都会被忽略。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:85
msgid ""
"Run `alembic upgrade head` (through `0120_operator_model_budgets`) before"
" starting this release; the [upgrade notes](docs/developer/upgrade-"
"notes.md) say what each recent migration changes. The main listener then "
"imports the settings from its environment. On an upgrade it imports only "
"fields a new migration added and never overwrites a saved value, even an "
"empty one. The other listeners wait for that import and use the same "
"saved values."
msgstr ""
"启动这个版本之前，先运行 `alembic upgrade head`（迁移到 "
"`0120_operator_model_budgets`）；[升级说明](docs/developer/upgrade-"
"notes.md)列出了最近每个迁移改了什么。随后主监听进程从自己的环境变量导入设置。升级时，它只导入新迁移增加的字段，绝不覆盖已保存的值，空值也不例外。其他监听进程等待这次导入完成，使用同一份已保存的值。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:92
msgid ""
"After that, edit values in **Admin → Settings**. **Reset** restores the "
"built-in default (empty for a credential), never an old environment "
"value. Listeners pick up changes within five seconds, and the web server "
"reads saved appearance on every request, with no rebuild or restart. "
"Existing user and compute encryption keys cannot be replaced or reset in "
"the editor; that needs a separate re-encryption procedure."
msgstr ""
"之后请在 **Admin → Settings** 中修改。**Reset** "
"恢复的是内置默认值（凭据的默认值为空），而不是旧的环境变量值。各监听进程在五秒内获取改动，Web "
"服务器每次请求都读取已保存的外观设置，无需重新构建或重启。已有的用户凭据加密密钥和计算凭据加密密钥不能在编辑器里替换或重置，这需要单独的重新加密流程。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:99
msgid ""
"The Settings page shows missing required fields and incomplete "
"integrations. A new deployment's first administrator signs in with the "
"one-time setup code the control plane logs and completes them there. When"
" no administrator can sign in, an operator with `ADMIN_TOKEN` can open "
"`/setup`, which uses the same audited settings API and keeps the token in"
" page memory only."
msgstr ""
"Settings "
"页面会标出缺失的必填项和未配置完整的集成。新部署的第一位管理员用控制平面日志里的一次性设置码登录，然后在这里补齐。没有管理员能登录时，持有 "
"`ADMIN_TOKEN` 的运维人员可以打开 `/setup`；它使用同一套有审计的设置 API，令牌只保存在页面内存里。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:105
msgid ""
"Host sandbox and workspace settings have their own precedence ([Sandbox "
"settings from the admin pages](#sandbox-settings-from-the-admin-pages)), "
"and sandbox archives are configured in Admin only ([Sandbox archives"
"](#sandbox-archives))."
msgstr ""
"主机的沙箱和工作区设置有自己的优先级规则（见[在管理页面设置沙箱](#sandbox-settings-from-the-admin-"
"pages)），沙箱归档只能在 Admin 中配置（见[沙箱归档](#sandbox-archives)）。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:109
msgid "Sandbox Manager naming compatibility"
msgstr "Sandbox Manager 的新旧名称兼容"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:111
msgid ""
"The service is **Sandbox Manager** (`sandbox-manager` in Compose, "
"`cloud_agent_host.sandbox_manager` in Python); use the "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_*` names. The previous names still work until "
"2026-12-31. The deploy scripts warn when one supplies a value and a "
"Python service logs `sandbox_manager_legacy_env`, but the fallbacks "
"inside the Compose files, the control plane's included, are silent. Check"
" each deployment's `.env` for:"
msgstr ""
"这个服务叫 **Sandbox Manager**（Compose 中为 `sandbox-manager`，Python 中为 "
"`cloud_agent_host.sandbox_manager`）；请使用 `AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_*` "
"这组名称。旧名称在 2026-12-31 之前仍然有效。旧名称提供了值时，部署脚本会发出警告，Python 服务会记录 "
"`sandbox_manager_legacy_env`；但 Compose 文件内部的回退不会有任何提示，控制平面的也一样。请检查每个部署的 "
"`.env` 中是否还有："

