#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:130
msgid ""
"A direct `docker compose` run must set `AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_TOKEN`; "
"only the host and local deploy scripts map the old token name. The "
"`sandbox-manager` service keeps `workspace-broker` as a network alias, "
"and the old `cloud_agent_host.workspace_broker` entry point no longer "
"exists. The rename needs no secret rotation or database migration. A few "
"old names stay on purpose: the `broker_url` column and the field in which"
" previous-release hosts report their address (new API fields use "
"`sandbox_manager_url`), the telemetry producer ID, and the paths "
"`/var/lib/freeinference-broker` (in retained sandboxes) and "
"`/var/lib/hybridinference/broker-archives` (in the manager), which hold "
"lifecycle fences and pending deletion receipts."
msgstr ""
"直接运行 `docker compose` 时必须设置 "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_TOKEN`；只有主机和本地部署脚本会转换旧的令牌名称。`sandbox-manager` 服务保留"
" `workspace-broker` 作为网络别名，旧的 `cloud_agent_host.workspace_broker` "
"入口已不存在。改名不需要轮换 secret，也不需要数据库迁移。有几处旧名称是有意保留的：`broker_url` "
"数据库列和上一版本主机上报地址所用的字段（新的 API 字段使用 `sandbox_manager_url`）、遥测的生产者 ID，以及路径 "
"`/var/lib/freeinference-broker`（在保留沙箱内）和 `/var/lib/hybridinference"
"/broker-archives`（在 manager 内），它们保存着生命周期栅栏和待处理的删除回执。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:141
msgid "The one rule"
msgstr "唯一的硬性规定"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:143
msgid ""
"The HybridInference Gateway's `API_KEY_SECRET` and `JWT_SECRET_KEY`, and "
"its database credentials, must never appear in this repository, in its "
"configuration, or on any host that runs it."
msgstr ""
"HybridInference Gateway 的 `API_KEY_SECRET`、`JWT_SECRET_KEY` "
"及其数据库凭据，绝不能出现在这个仓库里、它的配置里，或者任何运行它的主机上。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:147
msgid ""
"Cloud Agent keeps its own accounts and signs its own tokens with its own "
"secrets; it does not depend on the Gateway. An SMTP credential an "
"operator chooses to share is configuration: keep it in the operator's "
"secret store, never in this repository."
msgstr ""
"Cloud Agent 有自己的账号体系，用自己的 secret 签发令牌，不依赖网关。运维人员选择共用的 SMTP "
"凭据属于配置：把它放在运维人员的 secret 存储里，绝不能放进本仓库。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:152
msgid "Local development tools"
msgstr "本地开发工具"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:154
msgid "Local tooling reads these; they are not saved settings."
msgstr "这些值由本地工具读取，不是已保存的设置。"

