msgid "Value / who provisions"
msgstr "取值 / 由谁提供"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`CI_LOG_DIR`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Optional log directory for `scripts/ci-local.sh`: gate logs and the "
"database JUnit report. Defaults to a fresh gitignored `.local-"
"ci/<tier>.XXXXXX` directory in the checkout."
msgstr ""
"可选，`scripts/ci-local.sh` 的日志目录，存放各项检查的日志和数据库测试的 JUnit 报告。默认在仓库副本里新建一个被 "
"gitignore 的 `.local-ci/<tier>.XXXXXX` 目录。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:160
msgid "Local and CI permission regression"
msgstr "本地和 CI 的权限回归测试"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:162
msgid ""
"`AGENT_PERMISSION_TEST_IMAGE` turns on the opt-in Linux UID regression in"
" `tests/external/test_shared_member_permissions.py`. It names an already-"
"pulled Docker image with Python 3 and GNU `find`/`stat`, such as "
"`python:3.12-slim`:"
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_PERMISSION_TEST_IMAGE` 用于开启 "
"`tests/external/test_shared_member_permissions.py` 中按需运行的 Linux UID "
"回归测试。它指定一个已经拉取好、带 Python 3 和 GNU `find`/`stat` 的 Docker 镜像，比如 "
"`python:3.12-slim`："

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:171
msgid ""
"The test runs the production normalizer as separate member UIDs without "
"capabilities, in disposable containers with no network or mounts. CI runs"
" it before deployment; it needs no model API key or deployed service."
msgstr ""
"测试在没有网络、没有挂载的一次性容器里，以多个不带 capability 的成员 UID 运行生产环境的权限规整程序。CI "
"在部署前运行它；它不需要模型 API 密钥，也不需要已部署的服务。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:175
msgid "Local and CI restore regression"
msgstr "本地和 CI 的恢复回归测试"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:177
msgid ""
"`AGENT_RESTORE_TEST_IMAGE` names the base image for "
"`tests/external/test_checkpoint_restore_roundtrip.py`, `python:3.12-slim`"
" by default; pull it first. In real Docker, the test stops a chat "
"container as the Sandbox Manager does, checkpoints it, loads the "
"checkpoint as a later generation and starts it through the archive start "
"fence; only S3 is a local file:"
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_RESTORE_TEST_IMAGE` 指定 "
"`tests/external/test_checkpoint_restore_roundtrip.py` 的基础镜像，默认为 "
"`python:3.12-slim`，需要先拉取。测试在真实的 Docker 中像 Sandbox Manager "
"那样停止一个对话容器，为它做检查点，把检查点作为更新的一代加载，再通过归档启动栅栏启动；只有 S3 用本地文件代替："

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:187
msgid ""
"CI runs it before deployment; it needs no S3 bucket, model API key or "
"deployed service."
msgstr "CI 在部署前运行它；它不需要 S3 存储桶、模型 API 密钥或已部署的服务。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:190
msgid "Control plane (`cloud_agent`)"
msgstr "控制平面（`cloud_agent`）"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:192
msgid "Database"
msgstr "数据库"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_DATABASE_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Postgres DSN of a database only Cloud Agent uses. A new deployment starts"
" on an empty one. A database from before the independent-accounts release"
" is refused and kept as an archive ([cutover](docs/developer/upgrade-"
"notes.md#independent-accounts-cutover))."
msgstr ""
"只供 Cloud Agent 使用的数据库的 Postgres "
"DSN。新部署从空数据库开始。独立账号版本之前的数据库会被拒绝，并作为归档保留（见[切换说明](docs/developer/upgrade-"
"notes.md#independent-accounts-cutover)）。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_POSTGRES_USER` / `AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` / `AGENT_POSTGRES_PASSWORD`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"The bundled `postgres` service's user, the database the deployment uses "
"on it, and its password. User and database default to `cloudagent`; "
"PostgreSQL applies these only to an empty data directory. On a new "
"installation the `keys` service generates the password and a matching "
"DSN. `AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` must name the database `AGENT_DATABASE_URL` uses"
" on the bundled service, because the healthcheck, pgAdmin's bundled "
"server and the documented backup, drain and undrain commands open it; "
"while the two differ, the `keys` service logs a warning at every start."
msgstr ""
"自带 `postgres` 服务的用户、部署在其上使用的数据库，以及密码。用户和数据库默认都是 `cloudagent`；PostgreSQL "
"只在数据目录为空时应用这些值。新安装时由 `keys` 服务生成密码和对应的 DSN。`AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` 必须是 "
"`AGENT_DATABASE_URL` 在自带服务上使用的那个数据库，因为健康检查、pgAdmin "
"自带的服务器条目，以及文档中的备份、排空和取消排空命令打开的都是它；两者不一致时，`keys` 服务每次启动都会记一条警告。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"`TEST_DB_HOST` / `TEST_DB_PORT` / `TEST_DB_NAME` / `TEST_DB_USER` / "
"`TEST_DB_PASSWORD`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Read by `make test-db` and the CI `dbtest` tier as five separate values, "
"not a DSN. Defaults: `localhost` / `5432` / `hybridinference_test_db` / "
"`postgres` / `postgres`. The database name must contain `_test_`; "
"fixtures refuse other names. With xdist, each worker appends its ID and "
"needs a pre-created database. CI creates `<TEST_DB_NAME>_gw0`…`_gw3` for "
"`-n 4`."
msgstr ""
"`make test-db` 和 CI 的 `dbtest` 层级会把它们当作五个独立的值读取，而不是一个 DSN。默认值依次是 "
"`localhost` / `5432` / `hybridinference_test_db` / `postgres` / "
"`postgres`。数据库名必须包含 `_test_`，否则夹具会拒绝。用 xdist 并行时，每个 worker 会在名字后面加上自己的 "
"ID，并需要一个事先建好的数据库。CI 用 `-n 4` 跑，会建好 `<TEST_DB_NAME>_gw0`…`_gw3`。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:200
msgid "pgAdmin database administration"
msgstr "用 pgAdmin 管理数据库"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:202
msgid ""
"The optional `pgadmin` Compose profile adds **Admin → Database → Open "
"pgAdmin**. The service has no published port. Every request needs a "
"current `agent.admin` decision, and pgAdmin asks for its own login too. "
"Its accounts, sessions and saved connections persist in `agent-pgadmin`."
msgstr ""
"可选的 `pgadmin` Compose profile 会增加 **Admin → Database → Open "
"pgAdmin**。这个服务不对外发布端口。每个请求都需要当前有效的 `agent.admin` 判定，pgAdmin "
"还会要求登录它自己的账号。它的账号、会话和已保存的连接持久保存在 `agent-pgadmin` 中。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_PGADMIN_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Initial import*, as **Private pgAdmin URL**: the private origin, "
"`http://pgadmin:5050` for the bundled service. Empty disables the launch "
"link; credentials, paths, queries and fragments are refused. Start the "
"service with `COMPOSE_PROFILES=pgadmin`. The saved setting may only name "
"the bundled service or the scheme, host and port of this variable or "
"`AGENT_PGADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_URL`, so keep a custom address set here."
msgstr ""
"*首次导入*，保存为 **Private pgAdmin URL**：私有的 pgAdmin 地址，使用自带服务时为 "
"`http://pgadmin:5050`。留空则不显示打开入口；带凭据、路径、查询参数或片段的地址会被拒绝。用 "
"`COMPOSE_PROFILES=pgadmin` 启动这个服务。已保存的设置只能指向自带服务，或者本变量及 "
"`AGENT_PGADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_URL` 的协议、主机和端口，所以自定义地址要一直保留在这里。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_PGADMIN_PUBLIC_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Initial import.* Optional public proxy URL ending in "
"`/admin/agent/pgadmin`. Empty derives it from the saved web base URL plus"
" `/api/admin/agent/pgadmin`; set it for a separately mounted API. Never "
"derived from browser headers."
msgstr ""
"*首次导入*。可选的公开代理 URL，以 `/admin/agent/pgadmin` 结尾。留空时由已保存的 Web 基础地址加上 "
"`/api/admin/agent/pgadmin` 得出；API 单独挂载时需要设置。绝不会根据浏览器请求头推导。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_PGADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_DIR`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Required for dashboard setup.* `/var/lib/cloud-agent/pgadmin-bootstrap` "
"for the bundled service. The first administrator chooses pgAdmin's email "
"and password in **Admin → Database**. They are written once to the "
"private `agent-pgadmin-bootstrap` volume, readable only by the control "
"plane and pgAdmin's supplementary group, and never appear in responses, "
"audit records, Compose or source control. pgAdmin manages accounts and "
"passwords after that."
msgstr ""
"*在控制台初始化 pgAdmin 时必需*。使用自带服务时为 `/var/lib/cloud-agent/pgadmin-"
"bootstrap`。第一位管理员在 **Admin → Database** 中设定 pgAdmin 的邮箱和密码。它们只写入一次，存放在私有的"
" `agent-pgadmin-bootstrap` 卷中，只有控制平面和 pgAdmin "
"的附加组可读，绝不会出现在响应、审计记录、Compose 或源码中。此后的账号和密码由 pgAdmin 自己管理。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_PGADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Required for dashboard setup.* Private origin used only to initialize "
"the bundled service, normally `http://pgadmin:5050`. Setup saves it as "
"the pgAdmin URL when none is saved; later requests follow the saved "
"setting, including a reset that disables access."
msgstr ""
"*在控制台初始化 pgAdmin 时必需*。只用于初始化自带服务的私有地址，通常为 `http://pgadmin:5050`。尚未保存 "
"pgAdmin URL 时，初始化会把它保存为该设置；之后的请求都以已保存的设置为准，包括关闭访问的重置。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_PGADMIN_BOOTSTRAP_PUBLIC_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Optional.* Public proxy URL for first-time setup, ending in "
"`/admin/agent/pgadmin`, used while no public pgAdmin URL is saved. "
"Without either, setup derives it from the saved web base URL plus "
"`/api/admin/agent/pgadmin`."
msgstr ""
"*可选*。首次初始化时用的公开代理 URL，以 `/admin/agent/pgadmin` 结尾，只在尚未保存公开 pgAdmin URL "
"时使用。两者都没有时，初始化用已保存的 Web 基础地址加上 `/api/admin/agent/pgadmin`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_PGADMIN_ENTRYPOINT_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Optional.* Startup wrapper that waits for dashboard setup, then runs "
"pgAdmin's entrypoint. Defaults to the bundled `pgadmin-entrypoint.py`; "
"artifact deployments take it from the release recipe."
msgstr ""
"*可选*。启动包装脚本：等控制台初始化完成后再运行 pgAdmin 自己的入口程序。默认使用自带的 `pgadmin-"
"entrypoint.py`；制品部署从发布配方中取得。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_PGADMIN_SERVERS_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"*Optional.* Read-only server definitions, imported on first "
"initialization. The bundled `pgadmin-servers.json` registers "
"`postgres:5432` with the database and user that `AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` and "
"`AGENT_POSTGRES_USER` name and no password; the entrypoint fills in "
"`${AGENT_POSTGRES_DB}` and `${AGENT_POSTGRES_USER}` in a custom file too."
" Artifact deployments take the default from the release recipe."
msgstr ""
"*可选*。只读的服务器定义，在首次初始化时导入。自带的 `pgadmin-servers.json` 注册 "
"`postgres:5432`，数据库和用户分别取 `AGENT_POSTGRES_DB` 和 `AGENT_POSTGRES_USER` "
"的值，不带密码；自定义文件里的 `${AGENT_POSTGRES_DB}` 和 `${AGENT_POSTGRES_USER}` "
"同样会被入口程序替换。制品部署从发布配方中取得默认文件。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_PGADMIN_COOKIE_SECURE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Optional.* pgAdmin Python boolean, default `True`; `False` only for an "
"HTTP local stack. The proxy scopes pgAdmin's cookies to its route itself,"
" with HttpOnly, SameSite=Lax and, on HTTPS, Secure."
msgstr ""
"*可选*。pgAdmin 的 Python 布尔值，默认 `True`；只有本地 HTTP 环境才用 `False`。代理会自行把 pgAdmin"
" 的 Cookie 限定在它的路由下，并设置 HttpOnly、SameSite=Lax，在 HTTPS 下还会加上 Secure。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:218
msgid "Public addresses"
msgstr "公开地址"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Initial import.* Public web-app URL, for example "
"`https://agents.example.org`. Every emailed link is built from it, never "
"from a request's `Host`. The main API refuses with 403 a POST, PUT, PATCH"
" or DELETE that carries the session cookie and that the browser reports "
"as coming from another origin, unless that origin is this one, the "
"pgAdmin public URL's or, for a browser that sends no `Sec-Fetch-Site`, "
"the request's own host."
msgstr ""
"*首次导入*。Web 应用的公开 URL，例如 "
"`https://agents.example.org`。所有邮件中的链接都由它构造，绝不取自请求的 `Host`。对于携带会话 "
"Cookie、且浏览器报告来自其他源的 POST、PUT、PATCH 或 DELETE 请求，主 API 返回 403 "
"拒绝；例外是来源为这个地址、pgAdmin 公开 URL 的源，或者（浏览器未发送 `Sec-Fetch-Site` 时）请求自身的主机。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_PUBLIC_API_URL`"
msgstr "`AGENT_PUBLIC_API_URL`"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. *Initial import.* This API's public base URL with its prefix, for "
"example `https://agents.example.org/api`. OAuth callbacks (MCP sign-in, "
"compute registration) are built from it. It replaces the retired "
"`AGENT_SESSION_REDIRECT_URI`."
msgstr ""
"NEW。*首次导入*。本 API 带前缀的公开基础 URL，例如 `https://agents.example.org/api`。OAuth "
"回调（MCP 登录、计算节点注册）由它构造。它取代了已停用的 `AGENT_SESSION_REDIRECT_URI`。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:225
msgid "Retired Gateway variables"
msgstr "已退役的 Gateway 变量"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:227
msgid ""
"Cloud Agent no longer supports HybridInference Gateway sign-in, admission"
" or inference. Each variable below is refused: the control plane stops at"
" startup and names it, and `deploy/control-plane/deploy.sh` stops before "
"pulling anything ([cutover](docs/developer/upgrade-notes.md#independent-"
"accounts-cutover))."
msgstr ""
"Cloud Agent 不再支持 HybridInference "
"网关的登录、准入和推理。下面每个变量都会被拒绝：控制平面启动时会停下并指出它，`deploy/control-plane/deploy.sh` "
"会在拉取任何东西之前停止（见[切换说明](docs/developer/upgrade-notes.md#independent-"
"accounts-cutover)）。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
