#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:254
msgid "Own secrets"
msgstr "本服务自己的 secret"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SETTINGS_ENCRYPTION_KEY`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"The settings root key, at least 32 bytes, which encrypts the secrets "
"saved in Admin. Without it, `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` is the root. Every "
"listener must use the same effective root; keep it with every database "
"backup. Changing it, or rotating `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` while that is the"
" root, requires re-encrypting the saved settings first. The `keys` "
"service generates it on a new installation, never beside an "
"`AGENT_SESSION_SECRET`."
msgstr ""
"设置根密钥，至少 32 字节，用于加密 Admin 中保存的 secret。没有它时，以 `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` "
"为根。所有监听进程必须使用同一个实际生效的根密钥；每次备份数据库都要一并保存。更换它，或在 `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` "
"作为根时轮换后者，都必须先重新加密已保存的设置。`keys` 服务只在新安装时生成它，已有 `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` "
"时绝不生成。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Initial import*, generated into the first settings row when unset. "
"Encrypts the credentials users store, each kind in its own domain: "
"source-control credentials, MCP connections, environment variables and "
"Secrets, SSH server keys and model connection keys. The control plane "
"refuses to start without it. Use 32 random bytes, unique per environment;"
" a shorter value saved earlier still loads, and startup logs "
"`agent_weak_credential` until you replace it. Replacing it needs a "
"separate re-encryption procedure."
msgstr ""
"*首次导入*，未设置时生成到第一行设置中。用于加密用户保存的凭据，每类凭据使用各自的域：源码托管凭据、MCP 连接、环境变量和 "
"Secret、SSH 服务器密钥以及模型连接密钥。没有它，控制平面会拒绝启动。请使用 32 "
"个随机字节，每个环境各不相同；之前保存的较短值仍能加载，但在替换之前每次启动都会记录 "
"`agent_weak_credential`。更换它需要单独的重新加密流程。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_CONTROL_TOKEN_SECRET`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Initial import*, generated into the first settings row when unset. Signs"
" host and worker control tokens. Use 32 random bytes, unique per "
"environment; a shorter value saved earlier still loads, and startup logs "
"`agent_weak_credential` until you replace it. Replacing it invalidates "
"host and worker credentials, so hosts must re-enroll."
msgstr ""
"*首次导入*，未设置时生成到第一行设置中。用于签发主机和 worker 的控制令牌。请使用 32 "
"个随机字节，每个环境各不相同；之前保存的较短值仍能加载，但在替换之前每次启动都会记录 "
"`agent_weak_credential`。更换它会使主机和 worker 的凭据失效，主机必须重新注册。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SESSION_SECRET`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Legacy settings root, for an installation that never set "
"`AGENT_SETTINGS_ENCRYPTION_KEY`; no session uses it. If set, it must "
"differ from `AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`."
msgstr ""
"旧的设置根密钥，用于从未设置 `AGENT_SETTINGS_ENCRYPTION_KEY` 的安装；没有任何会话使用它。如果设置了，必须与 "
"`AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET` 不同。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_DEFAULT_EXECUTION_PROFILE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Initial import.* Isolation policy for new conversations. Application "
"default `trusted-v1`; the production Compose file sets `untrusted-"
"kata-v1` and the local one `trusted-v1`. The untrusted profile needs the "
"host's current enrolled credential and the claiming replica's attestation"
" of `io.containerd.kata.v2` with a guest kernel different from the "
"host's. The trusted profile allows runc, for trusted internal or "
"development repositories. Follow-ups and Fork keep the stored policy; "
"callers cannot choose it."
msgstr ""
"*首次导入*。新对话的隔离策略。应用默认值为 `trusted-v1`；生产 Compose 文件设为 `untrusted-"
"kata-v1`，本地 Compose 文件设为 `trusted-v1`。不可信档位要求主机持有当前有效的注册凭据，且认领的副本证明自己使用 "
"`io.containerd.kata.v2`、客户机内核与主机不同。可信档位允许 runc，用于可信的内部或开发仓库。后续消息和 Fork "
"沿用已保存的策略，调用方无法选择。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Initial import.* An operator-owned JSON webhook for queue incidents and "
"recoveries ([queue monitoring](docs/developer/deployment-reliability.md"
"#detection-after-deployment)) and compute replacement events. Unset, "
"events go only to the structured logs. Payloads carry the event, "
"deployment SHA and aggregate counts; compute events add the Host identity"
" and reason codes. Delivery times out after five seconds. The URL never "
"reaches runners or sandboxes."
msgstr ""
"*首次导入*。运维人员自己的 JSON webhook，接收队列异常及恢复事件（见[队列监控](docs/developer"
"/deployment-reliability.md#detection-after-"
"deployment)）和计算节点替换事件。未设置时，事件只写入结构化日志。负载包含事件、部署 SHA 和汇总计数；计算事件还带有 Host "
"标识和原因代码。投递超时为五秒。这个 URL 永远不会到达 runner 或沙箱。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_RESIDENCY_TTL_S`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Initial import.* How long a member's live-process residency survives "
"between host heartbeats, default 1800 seconds. It governs credential and "
"process ownership only: `AGENT_CHAT_IDLE_TIMEOUT_S` alone decides when a "
"settled sandbox group stops."
msgstr ""
"*首次导入*。成员活跃进程的 residency 在两次主机心跳之间能保留多久，默认 1800 "
"秒。它只管凭据和进程的归属：已结算的沙箱组何时停止，完全由 `AGENT_CHAT_IDLE_TIMEOUT_S` 决定。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`ADMIN_TOKEN`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Optional machine-to-machine admin credential, and the way into `/setup` "
"when no administrator can sign in. Unset, it grants nothing. Use at least"
" 32 random bytes; startup logs `agent_weak_credential` for a shorter "
"value."
msgstr ""
"可选。供机器之间调用的管理员凭据，也是没有管理员能登录时进入 `/setup` 的途径。未设置时不授予任何权限。请使用至少 32 "
"个随机字节；值较短时启动会记录 `agent_weak_credential`。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:267
msgid "Accounts"
msgstr "账号"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:269
msgid ""
"Every control-plane listener reads `AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET` from the "
"process environment only. Every other variable here is the initial value "
"of a setting in Admin → Settings → Accounts, imported once and edited "
"there afterwards. Saved secrets are encrypted and never shown again. See "
"[accounts](docs/developer/local-accounts.md)."
msgstr ""
"每个控制平面监听进程都只从进程环境变量读取 `AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`。这里的其他变量都是 Admin → "
"Settings → Accounts 中某项设置的初始值：只导入一次，之后在那里修改。已保存的 secret "
"会加密，且不再显示。见[账号](docs/developer/local-accounts.md)。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`"
msgstr "`AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_SECRET`"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Required: at least 32 random bytes, different from "
"`AGENT_SESSION_SECRET`; the `keys` service generates it on a new "
"installation. Keys the hashes of session cookies, emailed tokens and "
"abuse counters. Rotating it ends every session and outstanding link."
msgstr ""
"必需：至少 32 个随机字节，且与 `AGENT_SESSION_SECRET` 不同；新安装时由 `keys` 服务生成。会话 "
"Cookie、邮件中的令牌和防滥用计数器的哈希都以它为密钥。轮换它会让所有会话和尚未使用的链接失效。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_LOCAL_SIGNUP_ENABLED`"
msgstr "`AGENT_LOCAL_SIGNUP_ENABLED`"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Defaults to on. `false` closes public sign-up, by email and by phone; "
"existing accounts still sign in. Signing up never grants Agent use."
msgstr "默认开启。`false` 关闭邮箱和手机的公开注册，现有账号仍能登录。注册不会授予 Agent 使用权限。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_LOCAL_SIGNUP_REQUIRE_EMAIL_VERIFICATION`"
msgstr "`AGENT_LOCAL_SIGNUP_REQUIRE_EMAIL_VERIFICATION`"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. Defaults to `true`. `false` treats a new email account as verified "
"at sign-up and sends it no link, so sign-up works without SMTP. Such an "
"address is accepted, not proven: it matches neither the signup domain "
"list nor `AGENT_LOCAL_ADMIN_EMAILS` until a link sent to it is followed. "
"Accounts created while it was on still verify."
msgstr ""
"新增。默认为 `true`。`false` 会在注册时把新邮箱账号视为已验证，不发送链接，因此没有 SMTP "
"也能注册。这样的地址只是被接受，并未被证明：在点击发送到该地址的链接之前，它既不匹配注册域名名单，也不匹配 "
"`AGENT_LOCAL_ADMIN_EMAILS`。开启期间创建的账号仍需验证。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_LOCAL_SIGNUP_APPROVAL`"
msgstr "`AGENT_LOCAL_SIGNUP_APPROVAL`"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. `manual` (default): every account waits for an administrator. "
"`domains`: a verified account whose proven email domain is on the signup "
"domain list (Admin → Users → Sign-up policy) is approved at once; with an"
" empty list, every verified account is."
msgstr ""
"新增。`manual`（默认）：每个账号都等待管理员审核。`domains`：已证明邮箱的域名在注册域名名单（Admin → Users "
"中的“注册策略与登录记录”）中的已验证账号会被立即批准；名单为空时，所有已验证账号都会被批准。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_LOCAL_SIGNUP_ADMIN_NOTIFY` / `AGENT_LOCAL_SIGNUP_NOTIFY_EMAILS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. Mail administrators when a sign-up waits for approval (default on). "
"Recipients are the comma-separated list, or every local administrator "
"with a verified email when it is empty."
msgstr "新增。注册等待审批时通知管理员（默认开启）。收件人是逗号分隔的名单；名单为空时，是每个有已验证邮箱的本地管理员。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_LOCAL_TERMS_URL`"
msgstr "`AGENT_LOCAL_TERMS_URL`"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. Optional link to the Terms of Service the sign-up forms ask every "
"new account to accept. Acceptance is required either way."
msgstr "新增。可选的服务条款链接，注册表单会要求每个新账号接受。无论是否设置，都必须接受。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_LOCAL_SMS_ENABLED` / `AGENT_LOCAL_SMS_PROVIDER`"
msgstr "`AGENT_LOCAL_SMS_ENABLED` / `AGENT_LOCAL_SMS_PROVIDER`"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. Phone sign-up, sign-in and binding with a code sent by text message."
" Off (`false` / `none`) by default; on needs a configured provider "
"(`tencent`)."
msgstr "新增。通过短信验证码进行手机注册、登录和绑定。默认关闭（`false` / `none`）；开启需要配置服务商（`tencent`）。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"`AGENT_LOCAL_SMS_DEFAULT_COUNTRY_CODE` / "
"`AGENT_LOCAL_SMS_ALLOWED_PREFIXES`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. Digits prepended to a number typed without `+`, and the comma-"
"separated `+` prefixes codes may be sent to (empty: any)."
msgstr "新增。未以 `+` 开头的号码前面补充的数字，以及允许发送验证码的逗号分隔 `+` 前缀（为空表示不限）。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"`AGENT_TENCENT_CLOUD_SECRET_ID` / `AGENT_TENCENT_CLOUD_SECRET_KEY` / "
"`AGENT_TENCENT_CLOUD_TOKEN`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. Tencent Cloud CAM credentials of the `tencent` text message provider"
" (the token only for temporary credentials). This deployment's own; never"
" sent to a host or sandbox."
msgstr "新增。`tencent` 短信服务商的腾讯云 CAM 凭据（token 仅用于临时凭据）。这些是本部署自己的凭据，绝不会发送到主机或沙箱。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"`AGENT_TENCENT_SMS_REGION` / `AGENT_TENCENT_SMS_SDK_APP_ID` / "
"`AGENT_TENCENT_SMS_SIGN_NAME` / `AGENT_TENCENT_SMS_TEMPLATE_ID`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. The Tencent SMS application, its approved signature and its approved"
" template, which takes the code and its lifetime in minutes. Region "
"defaults to `ap-guangzhou`."
msgstr "新增。腾讯云短信应用、其已审核的签名和已审核的模板，模板接收验证码及其有效分钟数。区域默认为 `ap-guangzhou`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY` / `AGENT_TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. Cloudflare Turnstile for sign-up and phone codes. With no secret key"
" nothing is checked; with one, a missing or rejected token, or no answer "
"from Cloudflare, refuses."
msgstr ""
"新增。用于注册和手机验证码的 Cloudflare Turnstile。没有密钥时不做检查；有密钥时，缺少或被拒的 token、或 "
"Cloudflare 没有响应，都会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_LOCAL_ADMIN_EMAILS`"
msgstr "`AGENT_LOCAL_ADMIN_EMAILS`"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. Comma-separated, as HybridInference's `ADMIN_EMAILS`: an account "
"whose **proven** email is listed is approved and made an administrator "
"when it signs in. Proven means a link sent to the address was followed "
"(verification, address change or password reset) or the operator created "
"the account, never an address accepted while verification is off. The "
"list stays in charge: withdrawing a listed account's administration or "
"access is refused until the address is removed from it."
msgstr ""
"新增。逗号分隔，与 HybridInference 的 `ADMIN_EMAILS` "
"相同：**已证明**邮箱在名单中的账号，登录时会被批准并设为管理员。已证明是指点击过发送到该地址的链接（验证、修改邮箱或重置密码），或账号由运维人员创建，关闭验证期间接受的地址从不算已证明。名单始终优先：在地址从名单中移除之前，撤销该账号的管理权限或使用权限会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_LOCAL_TERMS_TEXT`"
msgstr "`AGENT_LOCAL_TERMS_TEXT`"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. Plain-text Terms of Service shown at `/terms` and in the sign-up "
"consent when `AGENT_LOCAL_TERMS_URL` is empty. Deployment Terms [site "
"content files](#site-content-files) replace both settings, which Admin "
"then shows read-only."
msgstr ""
"新增。`AGENT_LOCAL_TERMS_URL` 为空时，在 `/terms` "
"和注册同意步骤中显示的纯文本服务条款。部署提供了条款[站点内容文件](#site-content-"
"files)时，这两项设置都以文件为准，Admin 里显示为只读。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_TTL_DAYS`"
msgstr "`AGENT_LOCAL_SESSION_TTL_DAYS`"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "NEW. Lifetime of a new sign-in, default 30 days, never extended by use."
msgstr "新增。新登录的有效期，默认 30 天，不会因使用而续期。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"`AGENT_LOCAL_LOGIN_RATE_LIMIT_PER_15MIN` / "
"`AGENT_LOCAL_LOGIN_ACCOUNT_RATE_LIMIT_PER_15MIN` / "
"`AGENT_LOCAL_LOGIN_RATE_LIMIT_PER_HOUR_PER_IP`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. Sign-in windows: per account per address (5, also a recognized "
"browser's own window), per account from every address (50, counting only "
"attempts the per-address windows let through) and per address (20 an "
"hour)."
msgstr ""
"新增。登录窗口：每个账号每个地址（5 次，也是已识别浏览器自己的窗口）、每个账号所有地址合计（50 "
"次，只计入通过了按地址窗口的尝试），以及每个地址（每小时 20 次）。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"`AGENT_LOCAL_SIGNUP_RATE_LIMIT_PER_HOUR` / "
"`AGENT_LOCAL_SIGNUP_RATE_LIMIT_PER_DAY`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "NEW. Sign-ups per client address, 5 an hour and 10 a day."
msgstr "新增。每个客户端地址的注册次数，每小时 5 次、每天 10 次。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"`AGENT_LOCAL_SIGNUP_REQUIRE_RESOLVED_CLIENT_IP` / "
"`AGENT_LOCAL_UNRESOLVED_SIGNUP_RATE_LIMIT_PER_HOUR` / "
"`AGENT_LOCAL_UNRESOLVED_SIGNUP_RATE_LIMIT_PER_DAY`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. Sign-ups whose client address is unknown share one budget, 5 an hour"
" and 10 a day. With the first set to `true` they are refused (503) "
"instead."
msgstr "NEW。无法确定客户端地址的注册共用一个额度：每小时 5 次、每天 10 次。第一个变量设为 `true` 时，这类注册改为直接拒绝（503）。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_LOCAL_EMAIL_PROVIDER`"
msgstr "`AGENT_LOCAL_EMAIL_PROVIDER`"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. `smtp` (default), `tencent_ses`, or a registered transport. No "
"fallback between them."
msgstr "新增。`smtp`（默认）、`tencent_ses` 或已注册的传输方式。它们之间不会互相回退。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"`AGENT_TENCENT_SES_REGION` / `AGENT_TENCENT_SES_FROM_EMAIL` / "
"`AGENT_TENCENT_SES_FROM_NAME`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. Tencent SES region (`ap-guangzhou` or `ap-hongkong`), approved "
"sender address and display name, with the `AGENT_TENCENT_CLOUD_*` "
"credentials."
msgstr ""
"新增。腾讯云 SES 区域（`ap-guangzhou` 或 `ap-hongkong`）、已审核的发件地址和显示名称，配合 "
"`AGENT_TENCENT_CLOUD_*` 凭据使用。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"`AGENT_TENCENT_SES_TEMPLATE_VERIFICATION` / "
"`AGENT_TENCENT_SES_TEMPLATE_PASSWORD_RESET` / "
"`AGENT_TENCENT_SES_TEMPLATE_APPROVAL` / "
"`AGENT_TENCENT_SES_TEMPLATE_REJECTION` / "
"`AGENT_TENCENT_SES_TEMPLATE_ADMIN_SIGNUP` / "
"`AGENT_TENCENT_SES_TEMPLATE_NOTICE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. Approved SES template ids (0: none). Verification and password reset"
" are required; any other mail without its own template goes through the "
"notice template."
msgstr "新增。已审核的 SES 模板 ID（0 表示无）。验证和重置密码模板为必填；其他没有专属模板的邮件走通知模板。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SMTP_HOST` / `AGENT_SMTP_PORT`"
msgstr "`AGENT_SMTP_HOST` / `AGENT_SMTP_PORT`"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Mail relay for verification, password-reset and address-change links and "
"the account notices. Port defaults to 587, or 465 with "
"`AGENT_SMTP_SECURITY=tls`. Without a host and sender, email sign-up is "
"closed while verification is required, and recovery answers 503."
msgstr ""
"用于发送邮箱验证、重置密码和修改邮箱链接及账号通知的邮件中继。端口默认为 587；设置 `AGENT_SMTP_SECURITY=tls` "
"时默认为 465。未配置主机或发件人时，在要求验证的情况下邮箱注册关闭，账号恢复请求返回 503。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SMTP_SECURITY`"
msgstr "`AGENT_SMTP_SECURITY`"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`starttls` (default), `tls` for implicit TLS, or `none` for a local relay."
msgstr "可选 `starttls`（默认）、用于隐式 TLS 的 `tls`，或用于本地中继的 `none`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SMTP_USERNAME` / `AGENT_SMTP_PASSWORD`"
msgstr "`AGENT_SMTP_USERNAME` / `AGENT_SMTP_PASSWORD`"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Optional relay credentials. Never logged."
msgstr "可选的中继凭据，不写入日志。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SMTP_FROM`"
msgstr "`AGENT_SMTP_FROM`"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Sender address of account mail, e.g. `Cloud Agent <no-"
"reply@example.org>`. Links in it are built from `AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL` "
"only."
msgstr ""
"账号邮件的发件地址，例如 `Cloud Agent <no-reply@example.org>`。邮件链接只根据 "
"`AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL` 构建。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:302
msgid "Sandbox archives"
msgstr "沙箱归档"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:304
msgid ""
"Automatic lifecycle archives and **Archive to S3 and delete** share one "
"policy, set only in **Admin → Settings → Sandbox**; no environment "
"variable sets it or its destination. Archives go to `s3://<bucket>/cloud-"
"agent/sandbox`, and the bucket defaults to `freeinference`. The policy "
"holds the bucket, region, upload size limits, and either an AWS access "
"key, whose secret is encrypted with the settings key and never returned "
"by the admin API, or workload identity fields (a customer-managed KMS key"
" ARN and the expected bucket owner). Without an access key, sandbox "
"managers use the standard AWS SDK credential chain. Each Sandbox Manager "
"keeps the local state of both, restorable checkpoints included, in "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_ARCHIVE_STATE_DIR`. See [Sandbox "
"archives](docs/developer/operations.md#sandbox-archives) for IAM, bucket "
"versioning and rollout."
msgstr ""
"自动生命周期归档和 **Archive to S3 and delete** 共用一份策略，只能在 **Admin → Settings → "
"Sandbox** 中设置；没有任何环境变量能设置它或它的目标位置。归档写到 `s3://<bucket>/cloud-"
"agent/sandbox`，存储桶默认为 `freeinference`。策略包括存储桶、区域、上传大小限制，以及 AWS 访问密钥（其 "
"secret 用设置密钥加密，管理 API 永远不会返回）或工作负载身份字段（客户管理的 KMS 密钥 ARN "
"和预期的存储桶所有者）二者之一。没有访问密钥时，sandbox manager 使用标准的 AWS SDK 凭据链。每个 Sandbox "
"Manager 把两者的本地状态（包括可恢复的检查点）保存在 `AGENT_SANDBOX_ARCHIVE_STATE_DIR` "
"中。IAM、存储桶版本控制和上线步骤见[沙箱归档](docs/developer/operations.md#sandbox-archives)。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_COMPOSE_OVERRIDE_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Optional.* Absolute path to a private Compose override, kept outside the"
" checkout and limited to the main `control-plane` service. `deploy.sh` "
"requires a readable regular file and applies it after the release's own "
"overlays."
msgstr ""
"*可选*。私有 Compose 覆盖文件的绝对路径，放在仓库副本之外，只作用于主 `control-plane` 服务。`deploy.sh` "
"要求它是可读的普通文件，并在发布自带的覆盖文件之后应用它。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Standard AWS SDK credentials"
msgstr "标准 AWS SDK 凭据"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Needed only when the policy has no saved access key: the main control "
"plane then signs and verifies deletion archives through the SDK chain, "
"preferably with an IAM workload role. The base Compose file forwards no "
"AWS variables, so put environment or shared-profile credentials in "
"`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_COMPOSE_OVERRIDE_FILE`. No AWS credential reaches a "
"sandbox, the web app or the MCP listener."
msgstr ""
"只在策略没有保存访问密钥时需要：这时主控制平面通过 SDK 凭据链签名和校验删除归档，最好使用 IAM 工作负载角色。基础 Compose "
"文件不转发任何 AWS 变量，所以环境变量或共享配置文件形式的凭据要放进 "
"`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_COMPOSE_OVERRIDE_FILE`。任何 AWS 凭据都不会到达沙箱、Web 应用或 MCP "
"监听进程。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:322
msgid ""
"[Sandbox archive storage](docs/developer/operations.md#sandbox-archive-"
"storage) lists the permissions, retention and verification requirements."
msgstr ""
"权限、保留期和校验要求见[沙箱归档存储](docs/developer/operations.md#sandbox-archive-"
"storage)。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:325
msgid "Behaviour switches read by the control plane"
msgstr "控制平面读取的行为开关"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`COMPOSE_PROFILES` (`edge`, `pgadmin`, `github-relay`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Read by `docker compose`, not by the service. `edge` starts the nginx "
"edge for a deployment with its own hostname: `/api/*` goes to the control"
" plane with the prefix stripped, everything else to the web app. "
"`pgadmin` starts the private database UI. `github-relay` starts the "
"GitHub relay (see `AGENT_SANDBOX_GITHUB_RELAY_CA_FILE`). Combine them "
"with commas, for example `edge,pgadmin`."
msgstr ""
"由 `docker compose` 读取，而不是服务本身。`edge` 为拥有独立主机名的部署启动 nginx 边缘代理：`/api/*` "
"去掉前缀后转给控制平面，其余转给 Web 应用。`pgadmin` 启动私有的数据库管理界面。`github-relay` 启动 GitHub "
"中继（见 `AGENT_SANDBOX_GITHUB_RELAY_CA_FILE`）。多个 profile 用逗号连接，例如 "
"`edge,pgadmin`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_EDGE_BIND` / `AGENT_EDGE_PORT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Where the edge listens; defaults `127.0.0.1` / `3003`. Only meaningful "
"with the `edge` profile."
msgstr "edge 监听的地址和端口，默认 `127.0.0.1` / `3003`。只有启用了 `edge` profile 才有用。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_BIND` / `AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_PORT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Compose main-API binding, defaults `127.0.0.1` / `8000`. Put a TLS "
"reverse proxy in front of public access."
msgstr "Compose 里主 API 绑定的地址和端口，默认 `127.0.0.1` / `8000`。要对外开放，请在前面加一层 TLS 反向代理。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_MCP_RELAY_BIND` / `AGENT_MCP_RELAY_PORT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Compose MCP-only listener binding, defaults `127.0.0.1` / `8001`. Keep "
"sandbox tools on this listener."
msgstr "Compose 里 MCP 专用监听器绑定的地址和端口，默认 `127.0.0.1` / `8001`。沙箱的工具调用都要走这个监听器。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_MODEL_RELAY_BIND` / `AGENT_MODEL_RELAY_PORT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. Compose model relay binding, defaults `127.0.0.1` / `8002`. The "
"`model-relay` service always runs and refuses every request while no "
"provided connection exists. It adds the deployment's provider key to "
"requests that carry a running turn's placeholder, so only the hosts' "
"`model-tunnel` should reach it; keep it off the public edge. See "
"[Provided models](docs/developer/operations.md#provided-models)."
msgstr ""
"NEW。Compose 中模型中继的绑定地址，默认 `127.0.0.1` / `8002`。`model-relay` "
"服务始终运行，在没有部署提供的连接时拒绝所有请求。它会给带有运行中轮次占位凭据的请求加上部署的服务商密钥，所以只应让各主机的 `model-"
"tunnel` 访问它；不要把它暴露在公开的边缘代理上。见[部署提供的模型](docs/developer/operations.md"
"#provided-models)。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_WEB_BIND` / `AGENT_WEB_PORT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Compose web-server binding, defaults `127.0.0.1` / `3002`."
msgstr "Compose 里 Web 服务器绑定的地址和端口，默认 `127.0.0.1` / `3002`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_EDGE_CONFIG_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Host-side nginx configuration mounted read-only by the edge service. "
"Default `./edge.nginx.conf`, relative to the Compose file."
msgstr "edge 服务以只读方式挂载的、主机上的 nginx 配置文件。默认 `./edge.nginx.conf`，路径相对于 Compose 文件。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SITE_CONTENT_DIR`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Host-side directory of [site content files](#site-content-files) mounted "
"read-only by the control plane at `/etc/cloud-agent/site`. Default "
"`./site-content`, relative to the Compose file: the recipe's empty "
"directory, which configures none of them."
msgstr ""
"主机上存放[站点内容文件](#site-content-files)的目录，由控制平面以只读方式挂载到 `/etc/cloud-"
"agent/site`。默认是 `./site-content`，相对于 Compose 文件，也就是 recipe 自带的空目录，什么都不配置。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_NETWORK_NAME`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Control-plane Compose network name, default `cloud-agent`. Use distinct "
"names for independent stacks."
msgstr "控制平面 Compose 网络的名字，默认 `cloud-agent`。互相独立的几套部署要用不同的名字。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SESSION_COOKIE_SECURE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Initial import*, default on. Set `false` **only** for a whole stack on "
"plain `http://localhost`: a cookie without `Secure` can be taken by "
"anyone on the network path. On, the session and device cookies are "
"`__Host-cloud_agent_local_session` and `__Host-cloud_agent_device`, names"
" another host on the same site cannot set. Off, they use the plain names "
"`cloud_agent_local_session` and `cloud_agent_device`, which are never "
"read while it is on."
msgstr ""
"*首次导入*，默认开启。**只有**整套服务都跑在普通 `http://localhost` 上时才设为 `false`：不带 `Secure` "
"的 Cookie，网络路径上的任何人都能拿走。开启时，会话 Cookie 和设备 Cookie 分别为 `__Host-"
"cloud_agent_local_session` 和 `__Host-"
"cloud_agent_device`，同一站点下的其他主机无法设置这两个名称。关闭时使用普通名称 "
"`cloud_agent_local_session` 和 `cloud_agent_device`；开启状态下永远不会读取这两个名称。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_API_DOCS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Initial import.* Saved as **Serve API documentation** in Admin → "
"Settings → Operations, under Advanced; default off, checked on every "
"request. On, the main API serves `/docs`, `/redoc` and `/openapi.json`; "
"turn it on only on a development stack, because the schema is "
"unauthenticated and the two pages load scripts from a CDN at a floating "
"version. The MCP-only listener never serves them."
msgstr ""
"*首次导入*。保存为 Admin → Settings → Operations 中 Advanced 下的 **Serve API "
"documentation**；默认关闭，每次请求时检查。开启后，主 API 提供 `/docs`、`/redoc` 和 "
"`/openapi.json`；只在开发环境开启，因为这份 schema 不需要认证，而且两个页面会从 CDN 加载不固定版本的脚本。仅 MCP "
"监听进程永远不提供它们。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_MAX_STREAMS_PER_USER`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Initial import.* Saved as **Live streams per account** in Admin → "
"Settings → Operations, under Advanced (default `24`), checked when a "
"stream opens: how many live-update streams (the change stream and job "
"event streams) one account may hold open on one control-plane process. "
"One more answers 429 with `Retry-After`, which the web app backs off on. "
"A browser tab holds one change stream plus one per conversation it "
"watches."
msgstr ""
"*首次导入*。保存为 Admin → Settings → Operations 中 Advanced 下的 **Live streams per"
" account**（默认 "
"`24`），在打开流时检查：一个账号在一个控制平面进程上最多能同时保持多少条实时更新流（变更流和任务事件流）。超出的那一条返回 429 并带 "
"`Retry-After`，Web 应用会据此退避。一个浏览器标签页占用一条变更流，外加它正在查看的每个对话各一条。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Initial import*, default off. Set `true` only when a proxy you control "
"sits directly in front of the control plane and writes `X-Forwarded-For`;"
" both shipped nginx configurations overwrite it with the peer address. "
"The audit trail records only the rightmost entry, the one that proxy "
"wrote. Behind a further hop, such as a tunnel or load balancer in front "
"of the edge, the recorded address is that hop's unless the edge uses "
"nginx's realip module as its configuration describes."
msgstr ""
"*首次导入*，默认关闭。只有当你控制的代理直接位于控制平面前面并写入 `X-Forwarded-For` 时，才设为 `true`；随附的两份 "
"nginx "
"配置都会用对端地址覆盖这个头。审计记录只记最右边的一项，也就是那个代理写入的。如果边缘代理前面还有一跳，比如隧道或负载均衡器，记录下的就是那一跳的地址，除非边缘代理按其配置文件的说明启用了"
" nginx 的 realip 模块。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_RUNTIME_REGISTRY_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Initial import.* Saved as **Agent package registry** in Admin → Settings"
" → Agent versions; empty is `https://registry.npmjs.org`. Version lists "
"come from it, and each heartbeat answer tells hosts to download from it. "
"Until every online host reports the saved registry, the Agent versions "
"tab names the hosts still missing it and updates are refused. On a host, "
"this variable is only the registry before its first heartbeat answer. An "
"unreachable registry blocks updating and nothing else."
msgstr ""
"*首次导入*。保存为 Admin → Settings → Agent versions 中的 **Agent package "
"registry**；留空即 "
"`https://registry.npmjs.org`。版本列表来自这里，每次心跳应答也会让主机从这里下载。在所有在线主机都上报使用已保存的 "
"registry 之前，Agent versions "
"标签页会列出还没切换的主机，并拒绝更新。在主机上，这个变量只决定它收到第一次心跳应答之前使用的 registry。registry "
"不可达只会阻止更新，不影响其他功能。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_DEPLOYMENT_SHA`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"The exact commit this API serves. The production Compose stack requires "
"it and `deploy/control-plane/deploy.sh` exports it; do not edit it by "
"hand during a rollout. A host replica claims new retained groups only "
"while it advertises the completed marker for this commit, so a pending or"
" failed host deployment cannot claim through a freshly started API. The "
"local stack generates its own marker."
msgstr ""
"本 API 提供服务的确切 commit。生产 Compose 栈要求设置它，由 `deploy/control-plane/deploy.sh`"
" 导出；上线过程中不要手动修改。主机副本只有在报告了这个 commit "
"的完成标记后，才会认领新的保留沙箱组，所以尚未完成或失败的主机部署无法通过刚启动的 API 认领工作。本地环境会生成自己的标记。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:345
msgid "Source control"
msgstr "代码托管"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:347
msgid ""
"Every variable here except `AGENT_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH` and "
"`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY_FILE` is an *initial import* into Admin → "
"Settings → Source control (`AGENT_GITHUB_API` under Advanced)."
msgstr ""
"除 `AGENT_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH` 和 "
"`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY_FILE` 外，这里的每个变量都会*首次导入*到 Admin → Settings →"
" Source control（`AGENT_GITHUB_API` 在 Advanced 下）。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_ID`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"The GitHub App used for repository access. Setting it turns on key "
"loading; an unreadable key makes GitHub unavailable and is retried every "
"30 seconds. Configure the App's callback and setup URLs for this "
"deployment ([credentials](docs/developer/operations.md#2-credentials))."
msgstr ""
"用于访问仓库的 GitHub App。设置它会开启密钥加载；密钥无法读取时 GitHub 不可用，每 30 秒重试一次。请为这个部署配置 App "
"的回调 URL 和安装后设置 URL（见[凭据](docs/developer/operations.md#2-credentials)）。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_CLIENT_ID`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "GitHub App OAuth client ID for users connecting their own GitHub account."
msgstr "用户连接自己的 GitHub 账号时，用到的 GitHub App OAuth client ID。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_CLIENT_SECRET`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"GitHub App OAuth client secret. Store outside Git; rotate when changing "
"the App's audience."
msgstr "GitHub App 的 OAuth client secret。不要放进 Git；App 的使用对象变了，就要轮换它。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY_PATH`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Bootstrap.* Path inside the container to a read-only PEM key; the "
"supported Compose file mounts it at `/etc/cloud-agent/github-app.pem`. A "
"key saved in Admin Settings takes precedence. Keep private keys out of "
"environment variables, `docker inspect` output and logs."
msgstr ""
"*初始化配置*。容器内只读 PEM 密钥的路径；官方 Compose 文件把它挂载在 `/etc/cloud-agent/github-"
"app.pem`。Admin Settings 中保存的密钥优先。不要让私钥出现在环境变量、`docker inspect` 输出或日志里。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Host-side key file mounted read-only by control-plane Compose at `/etc"
"/cloud-agent/github-app.pem`. Default `/dev/null` supplies no key. This "
"differs from the in-container `_PATH` setting."
msgstr ""
"主机上的密钥文件，由控制平面的 Compose 以只读方式挂载到 `/etc/cloud-agent/github-app.pem`。默认 "
"`/dev/null`，也就是不提供密钥。注意它和容器里的 `_PATH` 设置不是一回事。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_PRIVATE_KEY`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Inline PEM, imported once where a deployment already supplies it. Compose"
" does not forward it. Set or replace an inline key in Admin Settings, "
"where it is encrypted and never returned to the browser."
msgstr ""
"内联的 PEM，部署已经提供时只导入一次。Compose 不转发它。请在 Admin Settings "
"中设置或替换内联密钥，它在那里加密保存，永远不会返回给浏览器。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_GITHUB_APP_INSTALL_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"`https://github.com` authorization/installation URL used by the Connect "
"GitHub flow; any other host, scheme or port is refused when saved or "
"imported. The App, OAuth credentials and this URL must all be configured "
"for user connections."
msgstr ""
"Connect GitHub 流程使用的授权和安装地址，必须是 "
"`https://github.com`；保存或导入时，主机、协议或端口只要不是这个就会被拒绝。用户要能连接 GitHub，App、OAuth "
"凭据和这个地址三样都得配好。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_GITHUB_COAUTHOR`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. The co-author agents name in their commits, as `Name <email>`. Use "
"the App bot's noreply address, `<bot-user-id>+<app-"
"slug>[bot]@users.noreply.github.com`, so GitHub shows its avatar beside "
"the owner's. Empty: commits name the owner only. Agents always author "
"commits as the conversation's owner."
msgstr ""
"NEW。agent 在提交中署名的共同作者，格式为 `Name <email>`。请使用 App 机器人的 noreply 地址 `<bot-"
"user-id>+<app-slug>[bot]@users.noreply.github.com`，这样 GitHub "
"会在所有者头像旁显示它的头像。留空时提交只署所有者。agent 始终以对话所有者的身份作为提交作者。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_GITHUB_API`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Default `https://api.github.com`: where the control plane sends GitHub "
"App, token and repository requests. GitHub Enterprise Server is not "
"supported: Connect GitHub uses GitHub.com's OAuth and installation URLs, "
"and the GitHub relay serves only `github.com` and `api.github.com`."
msgstr ""
"默认 `https://api.github.com`：控制平面发送 GitHub App、令牌和仓库请求的地址。不支持 GitHub "
"Enterprise Server：Connect GitHub 使用 GitHub.com 的 OAuth 和安装 URL，GitHub "
"中继也只服务 `github.com` 和 `api.github.com`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_GITLAB_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "GitLab.com OAuth application client ID for user connections."
msgstr "用户连接 GitLab 时用到的 GitLab.com OAuth 应用 client ID。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_GITLAB_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "GitLab.com OAuth client secret; store outside Git."
msgstr "GitLab.com 的 OAuth client secret，不要放进 Git。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_GITLAB_OAUTH_REDIRECT_URI`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Public OAuth callback URI registered with GitLab. Must use HTTPS, except "
"for localhost development, and anything else is refused when saved or "
"imported; update the registration when the deployment URL changes."
msgstr ""
"在 GitLab 上登记的公开 OAuth 回调地址。必须用 HTTPS（localhost "
"开发环境除外），其他情况在保存或导入时都会被拒绝。部署地址变了，要同步更新 GitLab 上的登记。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_REPO_ALLOWLIST`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Comma-separated `owner/name` entries or `owner/*` rules, matched case-"
"insensitively. Not per user: every user admitted to Cloud Agent may have "
"the platform clone the listed repositories with this deployment's GitHub "
"App, without connecting GitHub, so list only repositories all of them may"
" work on. It grants no push: agents push and open pull requests only with"
" their owner's own GitHub connection, through the GitHub relay. Empty "
"grants no allowlist access."
msgstr ""
"逗号分隔的 `owner/name` 条目或 `owner/*` 规则，匹配时不区分大小写。它不按用户区分：每个获准使用 Cloud Agent "
"的用户，都可以让平台用这个部署的 GitHub App 克隆列出的仓库，而无需连接 "
"GitHub，所以只列出所有这些用户都可以处理的仓库。它不授予推送权限：agent 只能通过 GitHub 中继、用所有者自己的 GitHub "
"连接推送和创建拉取请求。留空则不通过允许列表授予任何访问。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:367
msgid "MCP"
msgstr "MCP"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:369
msgid ""
"Cloud Agent owns MCP discovery, per-user credentials, authorization and "
"attempt fencing. Users add remote URLs, imported `mcpServers` snippets or"
" stdio launch specs; templates only prefill the form, and environment "
"variables neither add servers nor grant access to them. Credentials live "
"per user in `agent_mcp_connections`, encrypted with "
"[`AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY`](#own-secrets). The public base "
"URL, GitHub sign-in and both `ALLOW` switches below are *initial imports*"
" into Admin → Settings → MCP, all but GitHub sign-in under Advanced; the "
"switches apply to new MCP transports after the MCP listener restarts. The"
" MCP tunnel is a host setting ([Tunnels and relays](#tunnels-and-"
"relays))."
msgstr ""
"MCP 的发现、按用户保存的凭据、授权和 attempt 栅栏都由 Cloud Agent 负责。用户可以添加远程 URL、导入的 "
"`mcpServers` 片段或 stdio 启动配置；模板只预填表单，环境变量既不会添加服务器，也不会授予访问权限。凭据按用户保存在 "
"`agent_mcp_connections` 中，用 [`AGENT_SOURCE_CONTROL_ENCRYPTION_KEY`](#own-"
"secrets) 加密。下面的公开基础 URL、GitHub 登录和两个 `ALLOW` 开关都会*首次导入*到 Admin → Settings"
" → MCP，除 GitHub 登录外都在 Advanced 下；两个开关在 MCP 监听进程重启后，对新的 MCP 传输连接生效。MCP "
"隧道属于主机设置（见[隧道与中继](#tunnels-and-relays)）。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "~~`AGENT_MCP_CONFIG`~~"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Removed*; nothing reads it. It named one file of shared MCP servers and "
"credentials that every user used under one identity. Connections are per "
"user; delete it from `.env`."
msgstr ""
"*已移除*；没有任何代码读取它。它曾指定一个文件，里面是共享的 MCP 服务器和凭据，所有用户都以同一个身份使用。连接是按用户区分的；请从 "
"`.env` 中删除它。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_MCP_PUBLIC_BASE_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Optional override* of the public API base for MCP OAuth callbacks, "
"including the API prefix, for example `https://example.com/agents/api`. "
"The callback is `<base>/v1/agent/mcp/oauth/callback/<connection-id>`, "
"after which the browser returns to `<AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL>/integrations`. "
"Unset, `AGENT_PUBLIC_API_URL` is used; never derived from request "
"headers. With neither, browser authorization is unavailable and static "
"credentials still work."
msgstr ""
"*可选覆盖项*：MCP OAuth 回调使用的公开 API 基础地址，包含 API 前缀，例如 "
"`https://example.com/agents/api`。回调地址为 "
"`<base>/v1/agent/mcp/oauth/callback/<connection-id>`，处理完后浏览器回到 "
"`<AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL>/integrations`。未设置时使用 "
"`AGENT_PUBLIC_API_URL`；绝不根据请求头推导。两者都没有时无法在浏览器中授权，静态凭据仍可使用。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_MCP_GITHUB_CLIENT_ID` / `AGENT_MCP_GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Optional legacy import* for GitHub MCP browser sign-in. Register a "
"service-owned GitHub OAuth App or GitHub App with callback `<public API "
"base>/v1/agent/mcp/oauth/callback/github`. With both values and a public "
"callback base, the preset defaults to browser sign-in and each user "
"authorizes their own account. The client secret stays in encrypted "
"settings; user tokens stay in their MCP connections. Prefer a GitHub App "
"limited to the needed repositories and permissions (Contents and Pull "
"requests read and write when agents publish changes); an OAuth App "
"requests `repo` and `read:org`, and `repo` permits writes. A personal "
"access token remains an option for narrower access."
msgstr ""
"*可选的旧配置导入*，用于 GitHub MCP 的浏览器登录。注册一个归服务所有的 GitHub OAuth App 或 GitHub "
"App，回调地址为 `<public API "
"base>/v1/agent/mcp/oauth/callback/github`。两个值都有且配置了公开回调地址时，这个预设默认使用浏览器登录，每个用户授权自己的账号。client"
" secret 保存在加密的设置里，用户令牌保存在各自的 MCP 连接里。优先使用只授权所需仓库和权限的 GitHub App（agent "
"要发布改动时，需要 Contents 和 Pull requests 的读写权限）；OAuth App 会申请 `repo` 和 "
"`read:org`，而 `repo` 允许写入。需要更窄的访问范围时，也可以用个人访问令牌。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_MCP_ALLOW_PRIVATE_TARGETS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Whether a user-added MCP connection may dial private and loopback "
"addresses. Off by default: a connection that reaches loopback reaches "
"**this** service. Turn it on only for MCP servers on a private network "
"you trust. The ranges the platform never dials, such as the cloud "
"metadata service, stay refused."
msgstr ""
"用户添加的 MCP 连接能否访问私有地址和回环地址。默认关闭：能访问回环地址的连接，访问到的就是**本**服务。只有 MCP "
"服务器位于你信任的私有网络时才开启。平台从不访问的地址范围（比如云元数据服务）仍然会被拒绝。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_MCP_ALLOW_PLAIN_HTTP`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Whether a user-added MCP connection may use `http://`. Off by default, "
"because the credential would travel in the clear; it is separate from the"
" private-target switch because it is a separate risk."
msgstr "用户添加的 MCP 连接能否使用 `http://`。默认关闭，因为凭据会以明文传输；它与私有地址开关分开，因为这是另一种风险。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_MCP_SERVERS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Not operator-set.** The runner publishes the relay endpoints under this"
" name, as one JSON object of `{alias: url}`, for the image's CLI wrappers"
" to merge into their CLI's MCP configuration. A hand-set value would "
"point a sandbox at servers nobody connected."
msgstr ""
"**不由运维人员设置**。runner 用这个名称发布中继端点，形式是一个 `{alias: url}` 的 JSON 对象，供镜像里的 CLI "
"包装脚本合并进各自 CLI 的 MCP 配置。手动设置的值会让沙箱指向没人连接过的服务器。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_MCP_TOKEN`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Not operator-set.** The generated sandbox runtime config references "
"`${AGENT_MCP_TOKEN}` for the relay credential the runner injects at "
"launch, the chat process's residency credential. A hand-set value would "
"be a static tool credential shared by every job."
msgstr ""
"**不由运维人员设置**。生成的沙箱运行时配置用 `${AGENT_MCP_TOKEN}` 引用 runner "
"在启动时注入的中继凭据，即对话进程的 residency 凭据。手动设置的值会成为所有任务共用的静态工具凭据。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:390
msgid "Model connections"
msgstr "模型连接"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_MODEL_CONNECTIONS_ENABLED`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Whether owners may add model connections (OpenAI Chat Completions or "
"Responses, Anthropic Messages) and start turns on them, and whether turns"
" start on connections the deployment provides. On unless set to `0`, "
"`false` or `no`. Connections are the only inference, so off stops every "
"new turn; turns already admitted still run or fail. Set it to `false` to "
"hold new turns during maintenance or while some host or control-plane "
"replica still runs an earlier release, then unset it."
msgstr ""
"所有者能否添加模型连接（OpenAI Chat Completions 或 Responses、Anthropic "
"Messages）并在上面开始轮次，以及能否在部署提供的连接上开始轮次。除非设为 `0`、`false` 或 "
"`no`，否则开启。连接是唯一的推理来源，所以关闭后所有新轮次都不会开始；已准入的轮次照常运行或失败。维护期间，或者仍有主机或控制平面副本运行旧版本时，可以设为"
" `false` 暂停新轮次，之后再取消设置。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "~~`AGENT_DEFAULT_MODEL`~~"
msgstr "~~`AGENT_DEFAULT_MODEL`~~"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"**removed**. A new task starts on the model and connection of its owner's"
" newest turn, or the owner picks one; nothing reads this."
msgstr "**已移除**。新任务从其所有者最新一轮的模型和连接开始，或由所有者自行选择；没有任何地方读取这个变量。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:397
msgid "Web search"
msgstr "网页搜索"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`WEB_SEARCH_PROVIDER`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Optional initial import.* Provider behind the built-in `web_search` "
"tool: `auto` (default), `serper`, `brave` or `parallel`. Saved in Admin →"
" Settings → Web search; an existing deployment imports it once on upgrade"
" if it was never saved. The supported control-plane Compose file does not"
" pass it: set it in Admin Settings, or pass it through an override for "
"the import."
msgstr ""
"*可选的首次导入。* 内置 `web_search` 工具背后的提供方：`auto`（默认）、`serper`、`brave` 或 "
"`parallel`。保存在 Admin → Settings → Web "
"search；已有部署如果从未保存过它，会在升级时导入一次。受支持的控制平面 Compose 文件不传递它：请在 Admin Settings "
"中设置，或通过 override 文件传递以便导入。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`SERPER_API_KEY` / `BRAVE_SEARCH_API_KEY` / `PARALLEL_API_KEY`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Optional initial import.* Provider keys for the built-in `web_search` "
"tool, stored encrypted in Admin → Settings → Web search and never sent to"
" a sandbox. Imported once, as above."
msgstr ""
"*可选的首次导入。* 内置 `web_search` 工具的提供方密钥，加密保存在 Admin → Settings → Web "
"search，从不发送到沙箱。导入一次，同上。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:404
msgid "Sandbox settings from the admin pages"
msgstr "在管理页面上设置的沙箱参数"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:406
msgid ""
"These host settings are set from the admin pages, not in each host's "
"`.env`: `AGENT_TIMEOUT_S`, `AGENT_LEASE_TTL`, "
"`AGENT_CHAT_IDLE_TIMEOUT_S`, `AGENT_SOURCE_IMPORT_MAX_MIB`, "
"`AGENT_SHARED_RESIDENT_CAPACITY`, `AGENT_STORAGE_MIN_AVAILABLE_MIB`, "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_CPU_MILLICORES`, `AGENT_SANDBOX_MEMORY_MIB`, "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_DISK_MIB`, `AGENT_TERMINAL_IDLE_TTL_SECONDS`, "
"`AGENT_TERMINAL_HARD_TTL_SECONDS`, `AGENT_TERMINAL_MAX_SESSIONS` and the "
"limits in the table below. **Admin → Settings → Sandbox** sets a value "
"for every server (`PUT /admin/agent/host-settings`), with the terminal, "
"workspace and storage limits and **Turn lease** under Advanced, and a "
"server's details on **Servers** set one for that server alone (`PUT "
"/admin/agent/runner-hosts/<host>/settings`). A host uses, highest first:"
msgstr ""
"下面这些主机设置在管理页面中设置，而不是写在每台主机的 `.env` "
"里：`AGENT_TIMEOUT_S`、`AGENT_LEASE_TTL`、`AGENT_CHAT_IDLE_TIMEOUT_S`、`AGENT_SOURCE_IMPORT_MAX_MIB`、`AGENT_SHARED_RESIDENT_CAPACITY`、`AGENT_STORAGE_MIN_AVAILABLE_MIB`、`AGENT_SANDBOX_CPU_MILLICORES`、`AGENT_SANDBOX_MEMORY_MIB`、`AGENT_SANDBOX_DISK_MIB`、`AGENT_TERMINAL_IDLE_TTL_SECONDS`、`AGENT_TERMINAL_HARD_TTL_SECONDS`、`AGENT_TERMINAL_MAX_SESSIONS`，以及下表中的各项限制。**Admin"
" → Settings → Sandbox** 为所有服务器设置一个值（`PUT /admin/agent/host-"
"settings`），其中终端、工作区和存储限制以及 **Turn lease** 在 Advanced 下；**Servers** "
"中某台服务器的详情页只为这台服务器设置（`PUT /admin/agent/runner-"
"hosts/<host>/settings`）。主机按以下优先级取值，从高到低："

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:418
msgid "the value set for that server;"
msgstr "单独给这台服务器设置的值；"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:419
msgid "the value set for every server;"
msgstr "给所有服务器设置的值；"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:420
msgid "the built-in default."
msgstr "内置默认值。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:422
msgid ""
"Each heartbeat answer carries the complete effective values, so a host "
"applies a change within about 30 seconds, without a redeploy; clearing a "
"value falls back to the next level. A host's environment values apply "
"only until its first settings answer. Its first complete heartbeat also "
"imports its non-default values once as that server's values, unless an "
"administrator has already set or reset them. The registry, units and "
"bounds are in "
"[`cloud_agent_shared/host_settings.py`](apps/backend/cloud_agent_shared/host_settings.py);"
" the bounds are typo guards, not capacity statements."
msgstr ""
"每次心跳应答都携带完整的生效值，所以主机大约 30 "
"秒内就会应用改动，无需重新部署；清除某个值后回落到下一级。主机自己的环境变量值只在它收到第一次设置应答之前生效。它的第一次完整心跳还会把其中的非默认值作为这台服务器的值导入一次，除非管理员已经设置或重置过这些值。设置清单、单位和取值范围见"
" "
"[`cloud_agent_shared/host_settings.py`](apps/backend/cloud_agent_shared/host_settings.py)；这些范围只是防止输错，并不代表机器的容量。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:431
msgid ""
"Nothing running is interrupted. A turn keeps the time limit it started "
"with, and a sandbox keeps the session capacity and CPU, memory and disk "
"limits it was created with; Fork members share them. The sandbox manager "
"applies terminal limits from its next sweep. The page shows a value as "
"*applying* until the host confirms it. A runner that does not advertise "
"`host-settings-v1` keeps its `.env` values until it is redeployed, and "
"the page says so."
msgstr ""
"改动不会打断任何正在运行的东西。轮次沿用开始时的时间限制，沙箱沿用创建时的会话容量以及 CPU、内存和磁盘限制，Fork "
"出的成员共享这些限制。sandbox manager 从下一次巡检开始应用终端限制。在主机确认之前，页面会把值显示为 "
"*applying*。没有声明 `host-settings-v1` 的 runner 会继续使用 `.env` "
"中的值，直到重新部署，页面会注明这一点。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:438
msgid ""
"CPU is entered in vCPU and stored in millicores (1 vCPU = 1000); memory "
"and disk take MiB or GiB. The defaults are "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_CPU_MILLICORES=2000`, `AGENT_SANDBOX_MEMORY_MIB=4096` and "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_DISK_MIB=0` (no disk quota)."
msgstr ""
"CPU 以 vCPU 为单位输入，以毫核存储（1 vCPU = 1000）；内存和磁盘可用 MiB 或 GiB。默认值为 "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_CPU_MILLICORES=2000`、`AGENT_SANDBOX_MEMORY_MIB=4096` 和 "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_DISK_MIB=0`（不设磁盘配额）。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:442
msgid ""
"A positive disk limit sets Docker's `--storage-opt size=<MiB>M` on the "
"writable layer: the workspace, caches and installed files, not the image "
"or memory-backed temporary files. It needs Docker `overlay2` on XFS "
"mounted with project quotas (`pquota` or `prjquota`); otherwise Docker "
"refuses to create the container. A positive limit is recommended on every"
" server that runs `untrusted-kata-v1`, whose sandboxes otherwise share "
"one unbounded disk. A server at 0 still takes untrusted work; it logs a "
"warning, and the Servers page shows **No container disk quota**. Apart "
"from this limit, disk is guarded only at admission, by "
"`AGENT_STORAGE_MIN_AVAILABLE_MIB`."
msgstr ""
"磁盘限制为正数时，会在可写层上设置 Docker 的 `--storage-opt "
"size=<MiB>M`：包括工作区、缓存和安装的文件，不包括镜像和基于内存的临时文件。这需要 Docker `overlay2` "
"运行在挂载了项目配额（`pquota` 或 `prjquota`）的 XFS 上，否则 Docker 会拒绝创建容器。建议所有运行 "
"`untrusted-kata-v1` 的服务器都设置正数限制，否则它们的沙箱共享一块不受限的磁盘。设为 0 "
"的服务器仍会接收不可信的工作，但会记录警告，Servers 页面会显示 **No container disk "
"quota**。除这项限制外，磁盘只在准入时由 `AGENT_STORAGE_MIN_AVAILABLE_MIB` 把关。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Initial default / purpose"
msgstr "初始默认值 / 作用"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_TERMINAL_MAX_SESSIONS_PER_WORKSPACE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "4 open terminals per shared workspace."
msgstr "每个共享工作区最多同时打开 4 个终端。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_WORKSPACE_COMMAND_TIMEOUT_S`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "60 seconds for workspace commands and Git inspection."
msgstr "工作区命令和 Git 查看的超时时间，60 秒。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_WORKSPACE_FILE_WRITE_MAX_MIB`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "2 MiB for one workspace file replacement."
msgstr "单次替换工作区文件，最大 2 MiB。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_WORKSPACE_FILE_PREVIEW_MAX_KIB`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "512 KiB for one file preview."
msgstr "单次预览文件，最大 512 KiB。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_WORKSPACE_COMMAND_OUTPUT_MAX_MIB`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "2 MiB of workspace command output."
msgstr "工作区命令的输出，最多 2 MiB。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_WORKSPACE_DIRECTORY_MAX_ENTRIES`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "5,000 entries per directory listing."
msgstr "一次目录列表最多 5,000 项。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_WORKSPACE_DOWNLOAD_MAX_MIB`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "1,024 MiB for one whole-workspace download, measured before compression."
msgstr "一次下载整个工作区，最大 1,024 MiB，按压缩前的大小算。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_TERMINAL_BUFFER_MAX_MIB` / `AGENT_TERMINAL_BUFFER_MAX_EVENTS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "2 MiB / 4,096 events retained for terminal reconnects."
msgstr "为终端断线重连保留的内容：2 MiB / 4,096 个事件。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_TERMINAL_OUTPUT_MAX_MIB`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "32 MiB of output over one terminal's lifetime."
msgstr "一个终端从打开到关闭，最多输出 32 MiB。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_TERMINAL_INPUT_MAX_KIB`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "64 KiB of input per terminal request."
msgstr "每次终端请求最多输入 64 KiB。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_TERMINAL_MAX_STREAMS_PER_SESSION`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "4 concurrent viewers per terminal."
msgstr "每个终端最多 4 人同时查看。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:466
msgid ""
"The Sandbox Manager runs at most 16 workspace commands and Git "
"inspections at once per host and 4 per workspace; one more is refused "
"with 429. A command that times out or overflows its output limit is "
"stopped with its own process group, so other sessions and terminals in "
"the shared container keep running. A native CLI record over 8 MiB stops "
"its member process. Events are capped at 256 KiB, and text Postgres "
"cannot store (a NUL or an unpaired surrogate) becomes U+FFFD."
msgstr ""
"Sandbox Manager 同时运行的工作区命令和 Git 检查，每台主机最多 16 个，每个工作区最多 4 个；再多一个会以 429 "
"拒绝。超时或输出超限的命令会连同它自己的进程组一起被终止，共享容器里的其他会话和终端不受影响。超过 8 MiB 的原生 CLI "
"记录会让对应的成员进程停止。事件最大 256 KiB，Postgres 无法存储的文本（NUL 或不成对的代理项）会替换为 U+FFFD。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:473
msgid "Optional compute-resource management"
msgstr "可选：计算资源管理"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:475
msgid ""
"These values belong only to the stable main control plane, not its MCP-"
"only listener, any Host or any sandbox. See [the compute "
"runbook](docs/developer/operations-compute.md) for deployment profiles, "
"verified SSH access and CloudLab setup. Without them, manual Host "
"management still works."
msgstr ""
"这些值只属于稳定的主控制平面，不属于它的仅 MCP 监听进程、任何 Host 或任何沙箱。部署配置、经过验证的 SSH 访问和 CloudLab "
"设置见[计算资源运维手册](docs/developer/operations-compute.md)。不设置这些值时，手动管理 Host "
"仍然可用。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_COMPUTE_SANDBOX_IMAGE_REPOSITORY`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Where automatic Server setup looks for this release's sandbox image, "
"`<repository>:sandbox-<commit>`. Default `ghcr.io/harvardmadsys/cloud-"
"agent-sandbox`; empty turns the lookup off. When the image exists "
"(checked anonymously), the generated Host configuration pulls "
"`<repository>:sandbox-{deployment_sha}` with "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_IMAGE_PULL=true`, so its chats record a registry digest "
"and can be restored on another Host. Otherwise the Host builds its own "
"image and its chats stay on it."
msgstr ""
"自动服务器设置到哪里查找本版本的沙箱镜像 `<repository>:sandbox-<commit>`。默认 "
"`ghcr.io/harvardmadsys/cloud-agent-sandbox`；留空则不查找。镜像存在时（匿名检查），生成的 Host "
"配置以 `AGENT_SANDBOX_IMAGE_PULL=true` 拉取 "
"`<repository>:sandbox-{deployment_sha}`，这样它的对话会记录 registry digest，可以在另一台 "
"Host 上恢复。否则 Host 自己构建镜像，对话只能留在这台 Host 上。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_COMPUTE_SECRET_KEY`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Initial import*, generated when unset: the key, at least 32 bytes, for "
"stored compute connections and Admin-managed deployment profiles, itself "
"stored encrypted under the settings root key. Later `.env` values are "
"ignored, so you can delete the line; back up the settings root key with "
"the database."
msgstr ""
"*首次导入*，未设置时自动生成：用于加密已保存的计算连接和 Admin 管理的部署配置的密钥，至少 32 字节，它本身用设置根密钥加密保存。之后 "
"`.env` 中的值会被忽略，所以可以删掉这一行；设置根密钥要和数据库一起备份。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_COMPUTE_CONFIG`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Absolute path inside the control-plane process to the operator-owned JSON"
" deployment configuration."
msgstr "控制平面进程里能访问到的绝对路径，指向运维人员自己的 JSON 部署配置。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_COMPUTE_DIRECTORY`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Absolute host directory mounted read-only at `/run/compute` by the "
"optional Compose overlay; `deploy.sh` includes the overlay when this is "
"set."
msgstr ""
"主机上的一个绝对路径目录，由可选的 Compose overlay 以只读方式挂载到 "
"`/run/compute`；设置了这个值，`deploy.sh` 就会自动加上那个 overlay。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_SSH_HOST`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"First-time Server setup address of the service node. The supported "
"deployer defaults it to the node's FQDN, else its hostname; set it for "
"another deployment system or SSH alias. Saved setups take precedence."
msgstr ""
"服务节点在首次服务器设置时使用的地址。官方部署脚本默认使用节点的 FQDN，取不到时用主机名；使用其他部署系统或 SSH "
"别名时请设置它。已保存的设置优先。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_CLOUDLAB_API_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Initial import.* CloudLab's HTTPS Portal API, "
"`https://boss.emulab.net:43794`, not the portal's web address "
"`www.cloudlab.us`. Unset disables CloudLab."
msgstr ""
"*首次导入*。CloudLab 的 HTTPS Portal "
"API，`https://boss.emulab.net:43794`，不是门户的网页地址 `www.cloudlab.us`。未设置则不启用 "
"CloudLab。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_COMPUTE_REGISTRATION_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Initial import.* Optional HTTPS address new CloudLab nodes post their "
"SSH host keys to, ending in `/v1/compute/node-registrations`. Unset, it "
"is `AGENT_PUBLIC_API_URL` plus that path, when that URL is HTTPS. A node "
"checks the control plane's certificate before sending its one-time token."
" Without either, nodes that register their keys cannot be created."
msgstr ""
"*首次导入*。可选，新的 CloudLab 节点提交 SSH 主机密钥的 HTTPS 地址，以 `/v1/compute/node-"
"registrations` 结尾。未设置时，如果 `AGENT_PUBLIC_API_URL` 是 "
"HTTPS，就用它加上这个路径。节点在发送一次性令牌之前会校验控制平面的证书。两者都没有时，无法创建自行注册密钥的节点。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:491
msgid "Repository environments"
msgstr "仓库环境"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:493
msgid ""
"Reusable repository environments are always on; nothing configures them, "
"and a leftover `repository_environments_enabled=false` setting or "
"`AGENT_REPOSITORY_ENVIRONMENTS_ENABLED=false` is ignored. A task with no "
"variables or scripts uses the base environment without preparation; a "
"configured workspace needs an environment-capable runner and sandbox "
"manager."
msgstr ""
"可复用的仓库环境始终开启，不需要任何配置；遗留的 `repository_environments_enabled=false` 设置或 "
"`AGENT_REPOSITORY_ENVIRONMENTS_ENABLED=false` "
"会被忽略。没有变量或脚本的任务直接使用基础环境，不做环境准备；配置了环境的工作区需要支持环境的 runner 和 sandbox manager。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:499
msgid "Host agent (`cloud_agent_host`)"
msgstr "主机 agent（`cloud_agent_host`）"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:501
msgid "The stack's own identity"
msgstr "这套主机服务自己的身份"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:503
msgid ""
"`deploy/host/deploy.sh` and `deploy/host/sandbox_host.sh` read these, not"
" Compose: they name the stack rather than configure it."
msgstr ""
"这些值由 `deploy/host/deploy.sh` 和 `deploy/host/sandbox_host.sh` 读取，而不是 "
"Compose：它们给这套服务命名，而不是配置它。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`COMPOSE_PROJECT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Required host-stack project name, with no host default. It prefixes "
"containers, images and networks, and reusing a name lets a second "
"deployment recreate the first stack, so give sibling environments "
"distinct names such as `cloud-agent-sandbox-staging` and `cloud-agent-"
"sandbox-prod`. The control-plane deploy script defaults its own project "
"to `cloudagent`."
msgstr ""
"必需，主机这套服务的 Compose "
"项目名，主机侧没有默认值。它是容器、镜像和网络名称的前缀；名称重复会让第二个部署重建第一套服务，所以并存的环境要用不同的名称，例如 `cloud-"
"agent-sandbox-staging` 和 `cloud-agent-sandbox-prod`。控制平面部署脚本自己的项目名默认为 "
"`cloudagent`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_HOST_STATE_ROOT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Host path for enrollment state and readiness markers; host Compose "
"default `/var/lib/hybridinference/agent-host`. Use a unique path per "
"execution environment (required when `SIBLING_COMPOSE_PROJECTS` is set) "
"and back it up with retained host state."
msgstr ""
"存放注册状态和就绪标记的主机路径；主机 Compose 的默认值为 `/var/lib/hybridinference/agent-"
"host`。每个执行环境用不同的路径（设置了 `SIBLING_COMPOSE_PROJECTS` 时必须显式设置），并与保留的主机状态一起备份。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_RUNNER_STOP_GRACE` / `AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_STOP_GRACE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Compose shutdown windows, defaults `5m` / `30s`. The runner drains active"
" children; sandbox manager cleanup follows the runner drain."
msgstr ""
"Compose 关闭时的等待时间，默认分别是 `5m` / `30s`。runner 会先把正在运行的子进程排空，sandbox manager "
"的清理在 runner 排空之后进行。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`SIBLING_COMPOSE_PROJECTS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Comma-separated projects on this machine that belong to the other "
"environment. The deploy guard reports containers shaped like this stack "
"under any project it does not know, so name each legitimate sibling here."
" Setting it makes `AGENT_HOST_STATE_ROOT` required: sharing that path "
"would share an enrollment credential."
msgstr ""
"逗号分隔，这台机器上属于另一个环境的项目。部署检查会报告任何未知项目下形似这套服务的容器，所以每个合法的并存项目都要在这里列出。设置它之后必须设置"
" `AGENT_HOST_STATE_ROOT`：共用那个路径就等于共用注册凭据。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`SHARED_READY_TIMEOUT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Seconds the deploy scripts wait for the two parallel rollout halves, "
"default 900: the host for cold-start MCP and control endpoints, the "
"control deploy for a fresh exact-SHA heartbeat and reverse sandbox "
"manager probes. A rollout watchdog, not a chat timeout."
msgstr ""
"部署脚本等待并行上线的两半完成的秒数，默认 900：主机用它等待冷启动的 MCP 和控制端点，控制平面部署用它等待对应确切 SHA 的新心跳和反向"
" sandbox manager 探测。这是上线的看门狗，不是对话超时。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:514
msgid "Scheduling"
msgstr "调度"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_HOST_CREDENTIAL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"What `/v1/agent/host/register` returns. It authenticates and names this "
"machine's heartbeats and claims; there is no shared claim credential. "
"Removing the host revokes it. The runner normally reads the persisted "
"file (`AGENT_HOST_CREDENTIAL_FILE`) instead."
msgstr ""
"`/v1/agent/host/register` "
"返回的凭据。它认证这台机器的心跳和认领请求，并标识这台机器；不存在共享的认领凭据。移除主机即吊销它。runner "
"通常改为读取持久化的文件（`AGENT_HOST_CREDENTIAL_FILE`）。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_LEASE_TTL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Attempt lease length, default 120 seconds. *Host bootstrap*: the admin "
"**Turn lease** setting (41 to 900 seconds, for all servers or one) "
"replaces it from the next heartbeat, and a host imports this value once "
"as its own server setting. A turn renews with the lease it was claimed "
"with. See [Runner lease failures](docs/developer/runner-lease-"
"troubleshooting.md)."
msgstr ""
"attempt 租约的时长，默认 120 秒。*主机初始化配置*：管理页面的 **Turn lease** 设置（41 到 900 "
"秒，可针对所有服务器或单台）从下一次心跳起取代它，主机也会把这个值作为自己的服务器设置导入一次。轮次按认领时的租约续租。见 [runner "
"租约故障](docs/developer/runner-lease-troubleshooting.md)。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_TIMEOUT_S`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Hard limit on one running Agent CLI turn, default 3600 seconds. Reaching "
"it fails and fences the turn; it has nothing to do with chat idleness or "
"the sandbox lifecycle. The admin pages override it."
msgstr ""
"单个正在运行的 Agent CLI 轮次的硬性时限，默认 3600 "
"秒。到达时限会让该轮次失败并被栅栏隔离；它与对话空闲和沙箱生命周期无关。管理页面的设置优先于它。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_RUNNER_HOST`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Execution environment name redeemed by `AGENT_ENROLL_TOKEN` at first "
"registration. After enrollment the credential decides the identity, and "
"changing this value renames nothing; use `AGENT_PHYSICAL_HOST` to group "
"environments for display."
msgstr ""
"首次注册时用 `AGENT_ENROLL_TOKEN` 兑换的执行环境名称。注册之后由凭据决定身份，改这个值不会改名；要分组显示多个环境，请用 "
"`AGENT_PHYSICAL_HOST`。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:523
msgid "Sandbox Manager, runtime and reporting"
msgstr "Sandbox Manager、运行时与上报"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"How a runner reaches its sandbox manager, normally the Compose service "
"URL. The control plane always finds a sandbox manager through the "
"attempt's enrolled host row, never through this."
msgstr ""
"runner 访问自己的 sandbox manager 所用的地址，通常是 Compose 服务的 URL。控制平面总是通过 attempt "
"对应的已注册主机记录找到 sandbox manager，从不使用这个值。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"The sandbox manager URL the runner reports at enrollment, when it differs"
" from the one it dials. `deploy/host/docker-compose.sandbox.yml` requires"
" it, even on the control plane's machine, because separate Compose "
"networks cannot resolve the service name; only the integrated local stack"
" can omit it. Set it to the far end of the reverse forward "
"(`AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_REVERSE_BIND`/`_PORT`) and never without that "
"tunnel, or every terminal, file listing and Git status answers 503."
msgstr ""
"runner 注册时上报的 sandbox manager URL，用于它与 runner 自己访问的地址不同的情况。`deploy/host"
"/docker-compose.sandbox.yml` 要求设置它，即使部署在控制平面所在的机器上也一样，因为不同的 Compose "
"网络无法解析服务名；只有一体化的本地环境可以省略。把它设为反向转发的远端（`AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_REVERSE_BIND`/`_PORT`），而且必须有那条隧道，否则所有终端、文件列表和"
" Git 状态请求都会返回 503。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"The pool-wide sandbox manager credential: the control plane and every "
"host hold the same value. The control plane generates it into its first "
"settings row (or imports it), and server setup writes it into each host. "
"Host records hold URLs, not separate credentials, so a compromised host's"
" token authenticates to every other sandbox manager. When provisioning by"
" hand, compare SHA-256 fingerprints rather than display the secret; a "
"mismatch shows as 401 answers."
msgstr ""
"整个主机池共用的 sandbox manager "
"凭据：控制平面和每台主机持有同一个值。控制平面把它生成到第一行设置中（或从环境变量导入），服务器设置再把它写入每台主机。主机记录里只有 "
"URL，没有单独的凭据，所以一台被攻破的主机上的令牌可以通过其他所有 sandbox manager 的认证。手动配置时，比对 SHA-256 "
"指纹，而不是显示 secret；不一致时会表现为 401 应答。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_REVERSE_BIND` / "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_REVERSE_PORT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Required reverse listener for a standalone host. Bind the control plane's"
" stable Docker bridge gateway address, never loopback or `0.0.0.0`, and "
"give each simultaneously deployed Host its own port. The advertised URL "
"must match."
msgstr ""
"独立部署的主机必需的反向监听。绑定控制平面稳定的 Docker 网桥网关地址，不要用回环地址或 `0.0.0.0`，同时部署的每台 Host "
"各用一个端口。上报的 URL 必须与之一致。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_REVERSE_TARGET_HOST` / "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_MANAGER_REVERSE_TARGET_PORT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Host-side target of that reverse forward, defaults `sandbox-manager` / "
"`8092`."
msgstr "这条反向转发在主机这一侧的目标，默认 `sandbox-manager` / `8092`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"~~`AGENT_TUNNEL_*`~~ (~~`AGENT_TUNNEL_SSH_DESTINATION`~~) "
"(~~`AGENT_TUNNEL_SSH_PORT`~~) (~~`AGENT_TUNNEL_SSH_KEY`~~) "
"(~~`AGENT_TUNNEL_SSH_KNOWN_HOSTS`~~) (~~`AGENT_TUNNEL_REMOTE_HOST`~~) "
"(~~`AGENT_TUNNEL_REMOTE_PORT`~~) (~~`AGENT_TUNNEL_LISTEN_PORT`~~)"
msgstr "~~`AGENT_TUNNEL_*`~~（~~`AGENT_TUNNEL_SSH_DESTINATION`~~）（~~`AGENT_TUNNEL_SSH_PORT`~~）（~~`AGENT_TUNNEL_SSH_KEY`~~）（~~`AGENT_TUNNEL_SSH_KNOWN_HOSTS`~~）（~~`AGENT_TUNNEL_REMOTE_HOST`~~）（~~`AGENT_TUNNEL_REMOTE_PORT`~~）（~~`AGENT_TUNNEL_LISTEN_PORT`~~）"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "**removed**, refused by the host: the inference tunnel is gone."
msgstr "**已移除**，主机会拒绝：推理隧道已不存在。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "~~`AGENT_GATEWAY_HOSTNAME`~~"
msgstr "~~`AGENT_GATEWAY_HOSTNAME`~~"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "**removed**, refused by the host."
msgstr "**已移除**，主机会拒绝。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Initial import.* Comma-separated allowlist of the addresses hosts may "
"register as their sandbox manager, which then receive the pool "
"credential. A bare hostname admits that host on any scheme and port; a "
"`scheme://host:port` origin admits only that origin, which separates "
"sandbox managers behind one reverse-tunnel address. Unset accepts any "
"hostname; a multi-host pool should name its machines. URLs must be bare "
"origins, and link-local addresses, where cloud metadata answers, are "
"always refused. Automatic CloudLab setup expects the bridge address as a "
"bare hostname entry."
msgstr ""
"*首次导入*。逗号分隔的允许列表，限定主机可以注册为自己 sandbox manager "
"的地址，这些地址随后会收到主机池凭据。只写主机名时，允许该主机的任意协议和端口；`scheme://host:port` "
"形式的源只允许这一个源，可用来区分共用一个反向隧道地址的多个 sandbox "
"manager。未设置时接受任何主机名；多主机的池应列出自己的机器。URL "
"必须是不带其他部分的源；链路本地地址（云元数据服务所在）始终被拒绝。自动 CloudLab 设置要求网桥地址以单独主机名的形式列出。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Runner URL for registration, claims and heartbeats. Standalone Compose "
"derives it from the main-API tunnel alias `AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_HOSTNAME`,"
" not the MCP alias. Pointing it at the MCP-only listener returns 404 for "
"control requests."
msgstr ""
"runner 注册、认领和发送心跳用的地址。独立的 Compose 部署会根据主 API 隧道的别名 "
"`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_HOSTNAME`（不是 MCP 的别名）得出它。如果把它指向 MCP 专用监听器，控制请求都会返回 "
"404。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_WORKER_ID`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Worker-name prefix, default `runner`. The runner appends process identity"
" so concurrent turn children have distinct worker names."
msgstr "worker 名称的前缀，默认 `runner`。runner 会在后面加上进程标识，这样同时运行的轮次子进程，各自的 worker 名称都不一样。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_REPO_CLONE_BASE_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Base the trusted runner builds source clone URLs from, default "
"`https://github.com`; deployment configuration, never job input. The "
"complete local stack points it at its private `git://local-repo` fixture."
" `http`, `https` and `git` work for trusted mirrors, but a clone token is"
" sent only over HTTPS."
msgstr ""
"可信的 runner 构造源码克隆 URL 时使用的基础地址，默认 "
"`https://github.com`；属于部署配置，永远不是任务输入。完整的本地环境把它指向私有的 `git://local-repo` "
"测试仓库。可信镜像可以使用 `http`、`https` 和 `git`，但克隆令牌只通过 HTTPS 发送。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SOURCE_IMPORT_MAX_MIB`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Largest repository a new chat's first turn may import, in MiB; default "
"1024, accepted 1 to 65536. It counts the working tree **and** the fetched"
" commit's Git objects, which store most content a second time, so 600 MB "
"of files can already exceed 1024. Past it the turn fails before the agent"
" starts with `source checkout … exceeds this host's … retained import "
"size limit`, and a follow-up fails the same way: raise the limit or "
"shrink the repository. The clone stops at the limit, so it never fills "
"the disk. Each concurrent first turn spools the archive to the runner "
"container's disk, not memory, and the `docker cp` timeout grows by two "
"minutes per GiB. The admin pages override it."
msgstr ""
"新对话的第一个轮次可以导入的最大仓库，单位 MiB；默认 1024，允许 1 到 65536。它同时计入工作树**和**拉取的 commit 的 "
"Git 对象，而后者会把大部分内容再存一遍，所以 600 MB 的文件就可能超过 1024。超过时，轮次在 agent 启动前失败，报错 "
"`source checkout … exceeds this host's … retained import size "
"limit`，后续消息也会同样失败：请提高限制或缩小仓库。克隆到达限制就会停止，所以不会占满磁盘。每个并发的首轮都会把归档暂存在 runner "
"容器的磁盘上，而不是内存里，`docker cp` 的超时按每 GiB 两分钟增加。管理页面的设置优先于它。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_TERMINAL_IDLE_TTL_SECONDS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Closes an interactive terminal after this long with no input or output, "
"default 1800 seconds. It never stops the chat container. The admin pages "
"override it."
msgstr "交互式终端没有输入或输出达到这个时长后关闭，默认 1800 秒。它永远不会停止对话容器。管理页面的设置优先于它。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_TERMINAL_HARD_TTL_SECONDS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Longest lifetime of one terminal, even while in use, default 8 hours; it "
"bounds how long a terminal's credentials stay exposed. The admin pages "
"override it."
msgstr "单个终端的最长存活时间，即使仍在使用，默认 8 小时；它限制终端里的凭据暴露多久。管理页面的设置优先于它。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_TERMINAL_MAX_SESSIONS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Interactive terminals the sandbox manager holds open at once across all "
"chats, default 64, accepted 1 to 4096. The admin pages override it."
msgstr "sandbox manager 在所有对话中同时保持打开的交互式终端数，默认 64，允许 1 到 4096。管理页面的设置优先于它。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_RETAINED_DOCKER_DATA_ROOT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Expected daemon `DockerRootDir`; host and local Compose default "
"`/var/lib/docker`. A mismatch at sandbox manager startup fails retained "
"mode closed. To keep sandboxes on a data disk, bind `<disk>/docker` onto "
"`/var/lib/docker` and `<disk>/containerd` onto `/var/lib/containerd` and "
"leave this at `/var/lib/docker`; a non-default daemon `data-root` or "
"containerd `root` is rejected ([Retained Docker "
"storage](docs/developer/operations.md#retained-docker-storage-"
"on-a-host)). The path is never mounted into sandbox managers or "
"sandboxes. It is not a checkpoint or an off-node backup."
msgstr ""
"期望的守护进程 `DockerRootDir`；主机和本地 Compose 的默认值为 `/var/lib/docker`。sandbox "
"manager 启动时发现不一致，保留模式会以安全方式失败。要把沙箱放在数据盘上，就把 `<disk>/docker` 绑定挂载到 "
"`/var/lib/docker`、`<disk>/containerd` 绑定挂载到 `/var/lib/containerd`，并让这个值保持"
" `/var/lib/docker`；非默认的守护进程 `data-root` 或 containerd `root` 会被拒绝（见[主机上的保留"
" Docker 存储](docs/developer/operations.md#retained-docker-storage-"
"on-a-host)）。这个路径永远不会挂载进 sandbox manager 或沙箱。它不是检查点，也不是节点外备份。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_CONTAINERD_CONTENT_DIR`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Where the Sandbox Manager sees containerd's content store, read-only. "
"Code and host Compose default `/var/lib/hybridinference/containerd-"
"content`, bound from `AGENT_HOST_CONTAINERD_CONTENT_DIR` (default "
"`/var/lib/containerd/io.containerd.content.v1.content`, the system "
"containerd Docker uses for its image store). A restorable checkpoint then"
" copies only the commit's new layers; without the store it streams the "
"whole image through `docker image save`, slower but equivalent. Docker's "
"own managed containerd keeps the store under "
"`/var/lib/docker/containerd/daemon/io.containerd.content.v1.content`."
msgstr ""
"Sandbox Manager 以只读方式看到的 containerd 内容存储位置。代码和主机 Compose 的默认值为 "
"`/var/lib/hybridinference/containerd-content`，从 "
"`AGENT_HOST_CONTAINERD_CONTENT_DIR` 绑定挂载而来（默认 "
"`/var/lib/containerd/io.containerd.content.v1.content`，即 Docker 使用 "
"containerd 镜像存储时的系统 containerd）。这样可恢复检查点只需复制 commit 新增的层；没有这个存储时，就通过 "
"`docker image save` 流式导出整个镜像，更慢但结果相同。Docker 自己管理的 containerd 把存储放在 "
"`/var/lib/docker/containerd/daemon/io.containerd.content.v1.content` 下。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_UPLOAD_RECEIPT_DIR`"
msgstr "`AGENT_UPLOAD_RECEIPT_DIR`"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Attachment-import receipts, shared read-write by the runner and sandbox "
"manager. Host Compose sets `/var/lib/hybridinference/upload-receipts` and"
" binds only `${AGENT_HOST_STATE_ROOT}/upload-receipts` into the sandbox "
"manager, not the directory holding the host credential. Keep it durable "
"so imports stay incremental across service replacement. Unset, direct "
"execution uses `upload-receipts` beside `AGENT_HOST_CREDENTIAL_FILE`."
msgstr ""
"附件导入回执，由 runner 和 sandbox manager 共享读写。主机 Compose 将其设为 "
"`/var/lib/hybridinference/upload-receipts`，并且只把 `${AGENT_HOST_STATE_ROOT"
"}/upload-receipts` 绑定挂载进 sandbox "
"manager，而不是存放主机凭据的那个目录。请放在持久存储上，这样服务替换后导入仍是增量的。未设置时，直接执行会使用 "
"`AGENT_HOST_CREDENTIAL_FILE` 旁边的 `upload-receipts`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SANDBOX_ARCHIVE_STATE_DIR`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Sandbox Manager-only directory for stopped-container exports, deletion "
"receipts and checkpoint state (`checkpoints/`, `checkpoint-spool/`). Code"
" default `/var/lib/hybridinference/broker-archives`; host Compose binds "
"`${AGENT_HOST_STATE_ROOT}/sandbox-archives` there. Keep it durable so a "
"replacement sandbox manager can finish a verified deletion, and never "
"mount it into a sandbox. Exports are mode 0600 and hold repository files "
"and native session state, without credential tmpfs. Archives over 5 GiB "
"are refused and the original kept; at most four requests hold pending "
"archives per sandbox manager."
msgstr ""
"只供 Sandbox Manager 使用的目录，存放已停止容器的导出、删除回执和检查点状态（`checkpoints"
"/`、`checkpoint-spool/`）。代码默认值为 `/var/lib/hybridinference/broker-"
"archives`；主机 Compose 把 `${AGENT_HOST_STATE_ROOT}/sandbox-archives` "
"绑定挂载到这里。请放在持久存储上，这样替换后的 sandbox manager 能完成已校验的删除；永远不要把它挂载进沙箱。导出文件的权限为 "
"0600，包含仓库文件和原生会话状态，不含凭据 tmpfs。超过 5 GiB 的归档会被拒绝，原容器保留；每个 sandbox manager "
"最多有四个请求同时持有待处理的归档。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SHARED_RESIDENT_CAPACITY`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Member slots (separate UIDs and private tmpfs) built into each new shared"
" container, default 8, accepted 2 to 128. Fork reserves a free slot "
"first. It bounds the chats in one group; `AGENT_HOST_SLOTS` bounds the "
"turns a machine runs at once. The admin pages override it."
msgstr ""
"每个新建的共享容器内置的成员槽位（各自的 UID 和私有 tmpfs），默认 8，允许 2 到 128。Fork "
"会先预留一个空闲槽位。它限制一个组里的对话数；`AGENT_HOST_SLOTS` 限制一台机器同时运行的轮次数。管理页面的设置优先于它。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_CHAT_IDLE_TIMEOUT_S`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"The one inactivity clock for a retained chat group, default 1800 seconds."
" Turns, file and Git operations and terminal activity all advance it. "
"When it expires, the host runs `docker stop`, releases the group's bridge"
" and keeps the container and its writable layer; it never removes them. "
"Waking rebuilds the bridge and host rules before `docker start`. The "
"admin pages override it."
msgstr ""
"保留对话组唯一的空闲计时，默认 1800 秒。轮次、文件和 Git 操作以及终端活动都会推迟它。到期时，主机执行 `docker "
"stop`，释放该组的网桥，保留容器及其可写层，绝不删除。唤醒时先重建网桥和主机规则，再执行 `docker "
"start`。管理页面的设置优先于它。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_ENROLL_TOKEN`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"One-time enrollment token, minted at `POST /admin/agent/runner-hosts"
"/enroll-token` for a named `host` and redeemed once at `POST "
"/v1/agent/host/register` for the host credential. It lasts 15 minutes, is"
" hashed at rest and is shown once: if you lose it, issue another. "
"Registration under any other host name is refused without spending it, so"
" a typo cannot revoke a live machine's credential."
msgstr ""
"一次性注册令牌，通过 `POST /admin/agent/runner-hosts/enroll-token` 为指定的 `host` 签发，在"
" `POST /v1/agent/host/register` 兑换一次，换取主机凭据。有效期 15 "
"分钟，存储时只保存哈希，只显示一次：丢了就重新签发。用其他主机名注册会被拒绝，且不会消耗令牌，所以输错名字不会吊销正在运行的机器的凭据。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_HOST_CREDENTIAL_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Where the host credential persists, written mode 0600. The code default "
"is `/var/lib/hybridinference/agent-host-credential`, but host Compose "
"sets `${AGENT_HOST_STATE_ROOT:-/var/lib/hybridinference/agent-"
"host}/credential`, so **on a deployed host it lives under "
"`AGENT_HOST_STATE_ROOT`**; name that path when rebuilding or re-"
"enrolling. `AGENT_HOST_CREDENTIAL` in the environment wins over the file."
msgstr ""
"主机凭据的持久化位置，以 0600 权限写入。代码默认值是 `/var/lib/hybridinference/agent-host-"
"credential`，但主机 Compose 设为 "
"`${AGENT_HOST_STATE_ROOT:-/var/lib/hybridinference/agent-"
"host}/credential`，所以**在已部署的主机上，它位于 `AGENT_HOST_STATE_ROOT` "
"下**；重建或重新注册时要写这个路径。环境变量中的 `AGENT_HOST_CREDENTIAL` 优先于文件。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_DEPLOYMENT_SHA` / `AGENT_SHARED_LIVE_READY_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"The rolling-deployment fence, managed by the deploy scripts; never set "
"them to choose behavior. `deploy/host/deploy.sh` supplies the SHA and "
"`sandbox_host.sh` keeps the marker under `AGENT_HOST_STATE_ROOT`. A "
"runner does not poll for work until the `shared-sandbox-deployment:<sha>`"
" marker for its commit is complete, which also protects the previous API "
"during a parallel rollout."
msgstr ""
"滚动部署的栅栏，由部署脚本管理；永远不要为了选择行为而设置它们。`deploy/host/deploy.sh` 提供 "
"SHA，`sandbox_host.sh` 把标记保存在 `AGENT_HOST_STATE_ROOT` 下。在自己 commit 对应的 "
"`shared-sandbox-deployment:<sha>` 标记完成之前，runner 不会轮询工作，这在并行上线时也保护了上一版本的 "
"API。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_HOST_SLOTS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"How many turns this host runs at once until an admin sets a number on the"
" Servers page (`PUT /admin/agent/runner-hosts/<host>/slots`); default 3, "
"accepted 2 to 128 (a fork runs beside its parent). The runner claims only"
" while under the limit and starts one process per turn. A new number "
"arrives on the heartbeat answer and applies without restarting anything; "
"running turns are never interrupted. Lowering applies at once, raising "
"once the host confirms."
msgstr ""
"在管理员于 Servers 页面设置数值（`PUT /admin/agent/runner-"
"hosts/<host>/slots`）之前，这台主机同时运行的轮次数；默认 3，允许 2 到 128（Fork "
"会与父对话同时运行）。runner "
"只在低于上限时认领，每个轮次启动一个进程。新的数值随心跳应答下发，无需重启任何东西即可生效，正在运行的轮次绝不会被打断。调低立即生效，调高在主机确认后生效。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_RUNNER_REPLICAS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Removed*, not read. Concurrency is `AGENT_HOST_SLOTS` and the admin "
"page; `sandbox_host.sh` warns while it is set."
msgstr "*已移除*，不再读取。并发数由 `AGENT_HOST_SLOTS` 和管理页面决定；只要它还设置着，`sandbox_host.sh` 就会警告。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_RUNNER_VERSION`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Free-text version for the pool listing; never a compatibility gate."
msgstr "显示在主机池列表中的自由文本版本号；永远不作为兼容性检查。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_HOST_CAPACITY_ENABLED`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Whether the runner samples its Docker host's CPU, memory and retained-"
"container count for the Servers page; default on, `0`/`false`/`no`/`off` "
"turns it off (shown as not measured). Host Compose mounts only "
"`/proc/stat`, `/proc/meminfo` and `/proc/sys/kernel/random/boot_id` read-"
"only under `/run/host-metrics`, never all of `/proc` or `pid: host`, "
"because a shared pid namespace would show sandbox neighbours every "
"process on the machine. Sampling is best effort: a missing file is a "
"missing figure."
msgstr ""
"runner 是否为 Servers 页面采集 Docker 主机的 "
"CPU、内存和保留容器数；默认开启，`0`/`false`/`no`/`off` 关闭（显示为未测量）。主机 Compose 只把 "
"`/proc/stat`、`/proc/meminfo` 和 `/proc/sys/kernel/random/boot_id` 以只读方式挂载到"
" `/run/host-metrics` 下，绝不挂载整个 `/proc`，也不使用 `pid: host`，因为共享 pid "
"命名空间会让相邻的沙箱看到机器上的所有进程。采集尽力而为：缺少某个文件，就缺少对应的数据。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_HOST_STORAGE_PROBE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"How the Servers page's Storage column measures the filesystem under the "
"sandbox writable layers. `overlay_root` (default) reads the runner's own "
"root filesystem, which under OverlayFS describes that disk; `off` stops "
"measuring and reaches running replicas only after `up`. The host script "
"refuses any other value. A figure is published only after "
"`sandbox_host.sh` has attested the topology in `.storage-"
"probe/verdict.json`, comparing the container's numbers with `df` of the "
"mount root holding the upper directory. A failed check never blocks a "
"deployment: the runner reports `unverified`."
msgstr ""
"Servers 页面的 Storage 列如何测量沙箱可写层所在的文件系统。`overlay_root`（默认）读取 runner "
"自己的根文件系统，在 OverlayFS 下它反映的就是那块磁盘；`off` 停止测量，要执行 `up` "
"之后才会作用到已在运行的副本。主机脚本拒绝其他任何值。只有 `sandbox_host.sh` 在 `.storage-"
"probe/verdict.json` 中证明了存储拓扑之后，才会发布数值；证明方法是把容器读到的数字与 upper 目录所在挂载点根目录的 "
"`df` 结果比较。检查失败永远不会阻止部署：runner 报告 `unverified`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_STORAGE_MIN_AVAILABLE_MIB`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Free space a host keeps for new sandboxes, in MiB; default 1024, accepted"
" 1 to 1048576. Before a turn creates a sandbox, the runner reads "
"available space through the attested storage probe and declines the turn "
"when less remains; its launch error suggests freeing storage or changing "
"this setting. Existing sandboxes still resume. Unknown or unverified "
"capacity never counts as pressure. An admission guard, not a quota "
"([storage measurement](docs/developer/operations.md#how-full-is-the-"
"sandbox-storage)). The admin pages override it."
msgstr ""
"主机为新沙箱保留的空闲空间，单位 MiB；默认 1024，允许 1 到 1048576。轮次创建沙箱之前，runner "
"通过已证明的存储探针读取可用空间，不足时拒绝这个轮次，启动错误会建议释放存储或调整这项设置。已有沙箱仍可恢复。未知或未经证明的容量永远不算作空间紧张。这是准入检查，不是配额（见[存储测量](docs/developer/operations.md"
"#how-full-is-the-sandbox-storage)）。管理页面的设置优先于它。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_LOG_LEVEL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Log level, default `INFO`. The control plane imports it once into Admin →"
" Settings and applies changes without restarting; host processes read it "
"at startup."
msgstr "日志级别，默认 `INFO`。控制平面把它导入 Admin → Settings 一次，之后的修改无需重启即可生效；主机进程在启动时读取。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_LOG_FORMAT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"`text` (default) or `json`, one object per record with the structured "
"`extra` fields, uvicorn's included. The control plane imports it once "
"into Admin → Settings and applies changes without restarting; host "
"processes read it at startup. An unknown value warns and uses text. Pipe "
"`docker logs …` to `jq` to read JSON."
msgstr ""
"`text`（默认）或 `json`；后者每条记录一个对象，带有结构化的 `extra` 字段，uvicorn 的日志也一样。控制平面把它导入 "
"Admin → Settings 一次，之后的修改无需重启即可生效；主机进程在启动时读取。未知的值会产生警告并使用 text。要阅读 JSON "
"日志，把 `docker logs …` 通过管道交给 `jq`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_OPERATION_PROFILING_ENABLED`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Legacy static switch. With no `MODE`, `true` selects environment mode, "
"which needs a valid `RUN`; unset or `false` leaves control to Admin, with"
" collection off until an administrator starts a run. Ignored under "
"`MODE=admin`. In environment mode every producer (control plane, runner, "
"sandbox manager) needs the same descriptor. Read once per process."
msgstr ""
"旧的静态开关。没有设置 `MODE` 时，`true` 选择环境变量模式，此时需要有效的 `RUN`；未设置或 `false` 则交给 Admin"
" 控制，在管理员开始一次运行之前不采集。`MODE=admin` 时忽略它。环境变量模式下，每个生产者（控制平面、runner、sandbox "
"manager）都需要同一份描述。每个进程只读取一次。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_OPERATION_PROFILING_RUN`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"JSON descriptor of a static run: `run_id`, a non-empty `operations` list,"
" an absolute UTC `expires_at`, a positive `max_operations` and an "
"optional `target` naming `host`, `job_id`, `thread_id` or `sandbox_id`. "
"The operations are `attempt.startup`, which the runner roots, and "
"`files.list`, `files.open` and `terminal.open`, which the control plane "
"roots. An invalid descriptor leaves profiling off with one warning. A run"
" cannot outlast `expires_at`, even across restarts; at expiry its record "
"is emitted as partial (`profiling_stopped: \"expired\"`). "
"`max_operations` is a per-process budget, not a fleet-wide one."
msgstr ""
"静态运行的 JSON 描述：`run_id`、非空的 `operations` 列表、绝对 UTC 时间 `expires_at`、正数 "
"`max_operations`，以及可选的 `target`（指定 `host`、`job_id`、`thread_id` 或 "
"`sandbox_id`）。可测量的操作有 `attempt.startup`（由 runner 发起）以及 "
"`files.list`、`files.open` 和 "
"`terminal.open`（由控制平面发起）。描述无效时不开启采集，只记一条警告。运行时间不会超过 "
"`expires_at`，重启也不例外；到期时记录以不完整状态输出（`profiling_stopped: "
"\"expired\"`）。`max_operations` 是每个进程的额度，不是全体共享的额度。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_OPERATION_PROFILING_SINK`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Optional JSONL path for finished measurements, which are logged as well; "
"an external benchmark reads it. Delivery to Postgres and Admin does not "
"need it."
msgstr "可选，完成的测量结果写入的 JSONL 路径，结果同时也会写入日志；外部基准测试读取这个文件。投递到 Postgres 和 Admin 不需要它。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_OPERATION_PROFILING_MODE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Optional override of who controls collection: `admin`, `environment` or "
"`disabled`. Unset or blank means Admin, except that legacy `ENABLED=true`"
" keeps environment mode. `disabled`, or an invalid value, forbids "
"collection and makes the Admin switch unavailable. Read once per process;"
" ordinary Enable and Disable need no restart. The control plane and "
"runner sync in the background (about 30 seconds idle, 5 seconds active), "
"and Disable stops new selection while in-flight work keeps its deadline. "
"See the [default-control design](docs/agents/specs/2026-09-22"
"-measurement-admin-default.zh-CN.md)."
msgstr ""
"可选，覆盖由谁控制采集：`admin`、`environment` 或 `disabled`。未设置或为空表示由 Admin 控制，但旧的 "
"`ENABLED=true` 会保持环境变量模式。`disabled` 或无效值会禁止采集，并让 Admin "
"开关不可用。每个进程只读取一次；平常的 Enable 和 Disable 无需重启。控制平面和 runner 在后台同步（空闲时约 30 "
"秒，活跃时 5 秒）；Disable "
"会停止新的选取，进行中的工作保持原定截止时间。见[默认控制设计](docs/agents/specs/2026-09-22"
"-measurement-admin-default.zh-CN.md)。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_OPERATION_PROFILING_DEPLOYMENT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Which deployment's control row this control plane commands, default "
"`default`. Set it when deployments share a database (staging and "
"production), so neither can see or stop the other's experiment. It comes "
"from configuration, never from a request; a malformed value falls back to"
" `default` with a warning."
msgstr ""
"这个控制平面操作哪个部署的控制行，默认 "
"`default`。多个部署共用一个数据库时（比如预发布和生产）要设置它，这样谁也看不到、停不了对方的实验。它来自配置，永远不来自请求；格式错误的值会回落到"
" `default` 并记录警告。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:565
msgid ""
"The Compose files pass these through to each producer. Collection starts "
"disabled on a fresh database. The Admin Enable/Disable button controls "
"the persisted run without a restart, and a restart resumes an unexpired "
"run. While collection is disabled no operation reads the database, though"
" the background policy sync still runs. The Admin API reports "
"`max_operations` with `budget_scope=producer_instance`."
msgstr ""
"各 Compose 文件会把这些变量传给各自的生产者。在新数据库上，采集初始为关闭。Admin 的 Enable/Disable "
"按钮控制持久化的运行，无需重启；重启会恢复尚未到期的运行。采集关闭时，操作不会读取数据库，但后台的策略同步仍在运行。Admin API 在报告 "
"`max_operations` 时带有 `budget_scope=producer_instance`。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:572
msgid ""
"Two benchmarks answer different questions. "
"`scripts/bench_startup_profiling_overhead.py` measures the collector's "
"own cost on a synthetic attempt, with no container or network. "
"`scripts/bench_operation_overhead.py` drives the real control-plane "
"routes and database and, where a container runtime is available, the real"
" supervisor; it reports per-operation p50/p95 against an uninstrumented "
"cohort and the `max(10 ms, baseline p95 × 1%)` budget verdict. Read each "
"script's `what`/`not_what` block before quoting either."
msgstr ""
"两个基准测试回答不同的问题。`scripts/bench_startup_profiling_overhead.py` 在合成的 attempt "
"上测量采集器本身的开销，不涉及容器和网络。`scripts/bench_operation_overhead.py` "
"驱动真实的控制平面路由和数据库，有容器运行时时还驱动真实的 supervisor；它报告每个操作相对于未插桩对照组的 p50/p95，以及按 "
"`max(10 ms, baseline p95 × 1%)` 判定是否超出预算。引用任何一个的结果之前，先读脚本中的 "
"`what`/`not_what` 说明。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:581
msgid "Tunnels and relays"
msgstr "隧道与中继"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:583
msgid ""
"A host reaches the control plane only through SSH tunnels, each with its "
"own narrowly restricted key."
msgstr "主机只通过 SSH 隧道访问控制平面，每条隧道使用各自权限严格受限的密钥。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_MCP_TUNNEL_*`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"MCP-only SSH tunnel. Required suffixes: `SSH_DESTINATION`, `SSH_KEY`, "
"`SSH_KNOWN_HOSTS`. Defaults for `SSH_PORT` / `REMOTE_HOST` / "
"`REMOTE_PORT` / `LISTEN_PORT`: `22` / `127.0.0.1` / `8001` / `8000`. Its "
"remote destination must be the MCP-only listener; main API port 8000 "
"serves no tools."
msgstr ""
"仅用于 MCP 的 SSH "
"隧道。必需的后缀：`SSH_DESTINATION`、`SSH_KEY`、`SSH_KNOWN_HOSTS`。`SSH_PORT` / "
"`REMOTE_HOST` / `REMOTE_PORT` / `LISTEN_PORT` 的默认值：`22` / `127.0.0.1` / "
"`8001` / `8000`。它的远端必须是仅 MCP 监听进程；主 API 的 8000 端口不提供工具。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_MCP_HOSTNAME`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "The relay's alias on both container networks. Defaults to `agent-mcp`."
msgstr "中继在两个容器网络上的别名，默认 `agent-mcp`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SANDBOX_MCP_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Host only.* The MCP relay as this host's sandboxes reach it. Host "
"Compose derives it from the MCP tunnel "
"(`http://<AGENT_MCP_HOSTNAME>:<LISTEN_PORT>`) for the runner and sandbox "
"manager, which hand it to every member CLI with tools; the host rules "
"admit it. The control plane does not read it. Without it, a turn whose "
"owner connected a tool fails before any container work, telling the owner"
" to ask an admin to finish setting up the site."
msgstr ""
"*仅主机*。这台主机的沙箱访问 MCP 中继的地址。主机 Compose 根据 MCP "
"隧道推导出它（`http://<AGENT_MCP_HOSTNAME>:<LISTEN_PORT>`），交给 runner 和 sandbox "
"manager，再由它们交给每个带工具的成员 "
"CLI；主机规则放行这个地址。控制平面不读取它。缺少它时，所有者连接了工具的轮次会在任何容器操作之前失败，提示所有者请管理员完成站点配置。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_TUNNEL_*`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Runner-only SSH tunnel to the main API. Required suffixes: "
"`SSH_DESTINATION`, `SSH_KEY`, `SSH_KNOWN_HOSTS`. Defaults for `SSH_PORT` "
"/ `REMOTE_HOST` / `REMOTE_PORT` / `LISTEN_PORT`: `22` / `127.0.0.1` / "
"`8000` / `8000`. It joins only the runner network and is unreachable from"
" sandboxes."
msgstr ""
"只供 runner 使用、通往主 API 的 SSH "
"隧道。必需的后缀：`SSH_DESTINATION`、`SSH_KEY`、`SSH_KNOWN_HOSTS`。`SSH_PORT` / "
"`REMOTE_HOST` / `REMOTE_PORT` / `LISTEN_PORT` 的默认值：`22` / `127.0.0.1` / "
"`8000` / `8000`。它只加入 runner 网络，沙箱无法访问。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_HOSTNAME`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"That tunnel's alias, on the runner network only. Defaults to `agent-"
"control-plane`."
msgstr "这条隧道的别名，只在 runner 网络上有效，默认 `agent-control-plane`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SANDBOX_GITHUB_RELAY_CA_FILE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. *Host only.* The GitHub relay CA's certificate on this host, made by"
" `deploy/control-plane/github-relay-certs.sh`. With it and the `github-"
"relay` Compose profile on this host and the control plane, group bridges "
"resolve `github.com` and `api.github.com` to the host's `github-tunnel` "
"and members trust the CA, so git and `gh` reach GitHub as the "
"conversation's owner through the control plane's GitHub relay. Unset, "
"sandboxes reach GitHub directly and anonymously. See the "
"[design](docs/agents/specs/2026-11-04-agent-native-pull-requests.zh-"
"CN.md)."
msgstr ""
"NEW。*仅主机*。这台主机上 GitHub 中继 CA 的证书，由 `deploy/control-plane/github-relay-"
"certs.sh` 生成。设置了它，并且这台主机和控制平面都启用了 `github-relay` Compose profile 时，各组网桥会把"
" `github.com` 和 `api.github.com` 解析到主机的 `github-tunnel`，成员也信任这个 CA，于是 git"
" 和 `gh` 通过控制平面的 GitHub 中继、以对话所有者的身份访问 GitHub。未设置时，沙箱直接匿名访问 "
"GitHub。见[设计文档](docs/agents/specs/2026-11-04-agent-native-pull-requests"
".zh-CN.md)。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_GITHUB_TUNNEL_*`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. The GitHub relay's SSH tunnel, started by the `github-relay` "
"profile. Required with it: `SSH_DESTINATION`, `SSH_KEY`, "
"`SSH_KNOWN_HOSTS`. Defaults for `SSH_PORT` / `REMOTE_HOST` / "
"`REMOTE_PORT`: `22` / `127.0.0.1` / `8443`; it listens on 443 under the "
"names `github.com` and `api.github.com`. Its remote destination must be "
"the GitHub relay's listener (`AGENT_GITHUB_RELAY_BIND` / "
"`AGENT_GITHUB_RELAY_PORT` on the control plane, with its certificate and "
"key in `AGENT_GITHUB_RELAY_TLS_DIR`)."
msgstr ""
"NEW。GitHub 中继的 SSH 隧道，由 `github-relay` profile 启动。启用该 profile "
"时必需：`SSH_DESTINATION`、`SSH_KEY`、`SSH_KNOWN_HOSTS`。`SSH_PORT` / "
"`REMOTE_HOST` / `REMOTE_PORT` 的默认值：`22` / `127.0.0.1` / `8443`；它以 "
"`github.com` 和 `api.github.com` 这两个名称监听 443 端口。它的远端必须是 GitHub "
"中继的监听地址（控制平面上的 `AGENT_GITHUB_RELAY_BIND` / "
"`AGENT_GITHUB_RELAY_PORT`，证书和密钥在 `AGENT_GITHUB_RELAY_TLS_DIR` 中）。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SANDBOX_MODEL_RELAY_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. *Host only; written by Admin → Servers → Add server.* Where this "
"host's sandboxes reach the model relay: `http://` plus the `model-tunnel`"
" alias and port (`http://agent-models:8000` by default), a name, never an"
" address. Set, `sandbox_host.sh` requires the model tunnel's destination,"
" key and known_hosts, every group bridge carries the relay, and the host "
"advertises `model-relay-v1` and receives turns on connections the "
"deployment provides. Unset, it receives none; turns on owners' own "
"connections are unaffected. See [Provided "
"models](docs/developer/operations.md#provided-models)."
msgstr ""
"NEW。*仅主机；由 Admin → Servers → Add server 写入*。这台主机的沙箱访问模型中继的地址：`http://` 加上"
" `model-tunnel` 的别名和端口（默认 `http://agent-models:8000`），只能是名称，不能是 IP "
"地址。设置后，`sandbox_host.sh` 要求提供模型隧道的目标、密钥和 known_hosts，每个组网桥都会接入这个中继，主机声明 "
"`model-"
"relay-v1`，并接收在部署提供的连接上运行的轮次。未设置时不接收这类轮次；在所有者自己的连接上运行的轮次不受影响。见[部署提供的模型](docs/developer/operations.md"
"#provided-models)。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_MODEL_TUNNEL_*`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"NEW. *Written by Add server.* The model relay's SSH tunnel. Its `model-"
"tunnel` service runs on every host and waits idle without "
"`SSH_DESTINATION`. Required with `AGENT_SANDBOX_MODEL_RELAY_URL`: "
"`SSH_DESTINATION`, `SSH_KEY`, `SSH_KNOWN_HOSTS`. Defaults for `SSH_PORT` "
"/ `REMOTE_HOST` / `REMOTE_PORT` / `LISTEN_PORT`: `22` / `127.0.0.1` / "
"`8002` / `8000`; `AGENT_MODEL_RELAY_HOSTNAME` (default `agent-models`) is"
" its name on a group bridge. Its remote destination must be the model "
"relay's listener. Add server gives it its own key, with a `permitopen` "
"for that port only, on its own account on the control-plane machine; set "
"these by hand only on a host Add server did not set up."
msgstr ""
"NEW。*由 Add server 写入*。模型中继的 SSH 隧道。它的 `model-tunnel` 服务在每台主机上运行，没有 "
"`SSH_DESTINATION` 时空闲等待。设置 `AGENT_SANDBOX_MODEL_RELAY_URL` "
"时必需：`SSH_DESTINATION`、`SSH_KEY`、`SSH_KNOWN_HOSTS`。`SSH_PORT` / "
"`REMOTE_HOST` / `REMOTE_PORT` / `LISTEN_PORT` 的默认值：`22` / `127.0.0.1` / "
"`8002` / `8000`；`AGENT_MODEL_RELAY_HOSTNAME`（默认 `agent-"
"models`）是它在组网桥上的名称。它的远端必须是模型中继的监听地址。Add server "
"会在控制平面机器上为它创建单独的账号和单独的密钥，并用 `permitopen` 只放行那个端口；只有不是由 Add server "
"配置的主机才需要手动设置这些值。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:598
msgid "Physical servers and execution environments"
msgstr "物理服务器和执行环境"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:600
msgid ""
"`AGENT_RUNNER_HOST` identifies one enrolled execution environment. Two "
"stacks on one physical server that talk to one control plane need "
"distinct names, credentials, state roots and sandbox manager URLs. Do not"
" rename or re-enroll an existing environment to merge its retained chats "
"with another."
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_RUNNER_HOST` "
"标识一个已注册的执行环境。同一台物理服务器上连接同一个控制平面的两套服务，需要不同的名称、凭据、状态根目录和 sandbox manager "
"URL。不要为了把保留的对话合并到另一个环境而给现有环境改名或重新注册。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:605
msgid ""
"`AGENT_PHYSICAL_HOST` names the physical server in the admin inventory: "
"give every environment on it the same name, unique within the control "
"plane. `deploy/host/sandbox_host.sh` defaults it to the short hostname; "
"direct Compose deployments must set it. Runners send it at registration "
"and on each heartbeat (`labels.physical_host`). Set it before host "
"activation and follow the [rolling deployment "
"order](docs/developer/operations.md#rolling-deployment-order)."
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_PHYSICAL_HOST` "
"是物理服务器在管理清单中的名称：同一台服务器上的所有环境用同一个名称，在控制平面内唯一。`deploy/host/sandbox_host.sh`"
" 默认使用短主机名；直接用 Compose 部署时必须设置。runner "
"在注册和每次心跳时发送它（`labels.physical_host`）。请在主机激活之前设置，并按[滚动部署顺序](docs/developer/operations.md"
"#rolling-deployment-order)操作。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:612
msgid ""
"The Servers table shows, for each physical server, the executor that "
"matches the new-chat execution policy. Keep one placement executor per "
"physical server, and retire extra old deployments once their retained "
"conversations are no longer needed. Slots are an environment's "
"concurrency limit, not GPU counts. The global sandbox location is "
"described in [Compute resources](docs/developer/operations-compute.md)."
msgstr ""
"Servers "
"表为每台物理服务器显示符合新对话执行策略的执行器。每台物理服务器只保留一个用于放置的执行器，多余的旧部署在其保留对话不再需要后退役。槽位是一个环境的并发上限，不是"
" GPU 数量。全局沙箱位置见[计算资源](docs/developer/operations-compute.md)。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:619
msgid "Sandbox isolation (host agent reads, sandbox inherits)"
msgstr "沙箱隔离（由主机 agent 读取，沙箱沿用）"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SANDBOX_BACKEND`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Defaults to `kata`. `container` is the explicit trusted-repository "
"downgrade. `process` is a non-claimable test seam and cannot serve "
"retained chats."
msgstr ""
"默认 `kata`。`container` 是明确选择的降级方案，只用于受信任的仓库。`process` "
"只是测试用的接口，不能被认领，也不能服务保留对话。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SANDBOX_RUNTIME`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Unset selects `io.containerd.kata.v2` with backend `kata`, or Docker's "
"default runtime with backend `container`. Set `runc` only for the trusted"
" execution profile. The untrusted profile requires exactly "
"`io.containerd.kata.v2`; gVisor needs a separate execution profile."
msgstr ""
"不设置时：后端是 `kata` 就用 `io.containerd.kata.v2`，后端是 `container` 就用 Docker "
"的默认运行时。只有受信任的 execution profile 才能设成 `runc`。不受信任的 profile 必须正好是 "
"`io.containerd.kata.v2`；要用 gVisor，需要另外定义一个 execution profile。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SANDBOX_IMAGE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Required sandbox image, with no application default. Use distinct tags "
"for sibling environments, such as `cloud-agent-job:staging` / `:prod`, so"
" one rebuild cannot replace the other's image. This is the job image, "
"distinct from the runner image."
msgstr ""
"沙箱镜像，必填，应用没有默认值。同一台机器上的不同环境要用不同的标签，例如 `cloud-agent-job:staging` / "
"`:prod`，免得一次重建把另一个环境的镜像覆盖掉。这是任务镜像，和 runner 镜像不是一回事。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SANDBOX_IMAGE_PULL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`true` makes a source deployment (`sandbox_host.sh`) pull "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_IMAGE` instead of building it; default `false`. Use the "
"image published for the deployed commit, for example "
"`ghcr.io/harvardmadsys/cloud-agent-sandbox:sandbox-<sha>` (an autoscaling"
" template can write `{deployment_sha}`). A pulled image is recorded by "
"its registry digest, so another host can restore this host's chats from "
"their checkpoints; a locally built image cannot be fetched elsewhere, so "
"its groups stay on this host. Artifact deployments always pull."
msgstr ""
"设为 `true` 时，源码部署（`sandbox_host.sh`）会拉取 `AGENT_SANDBOX_IMAGE` 而不是自己构建；默认 "
"`false`。请使用为所部署 commit 发布的镜像，例如 `ghcr.io/harvardmadsys/cloud-agent-"
"sandbox:sandbox-<sha>`（自动扩缩容模板可以写 `{deployment_sha}`）。拉取的镜像按 registry "
"digest 记录，所以其他主机能从检查点恢复这台主机的对话；本地构建的镜像别处取不到，它的组只能留在这台主机上。制品部署总是拉取镜像。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SANDBOX_NAMESPACE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Required.* Stable deployment namespace stamped onto retained containers "
"and group bridges, so sibling stacks on one Docker daemon cannot "
"discover, stop or prune each other's chats. It also names this "
"deployment's nftables table and bridge-interface prefix; a runner or "
"sandbox manager without one refuses to start. The host stack uses its "
"Compose project; the complete local stack derives it from "
"`LOCAL_PROJECT_NAME`."
msgstr ""
"*必需*。稳定的部署命名空间，标记在保留容器和组网桥上，使同一个 Docker "
"守护进程上并存的几套服务无法发现、停止或清理彼此的对话。它还用作这个部署的 nftables 表名和网桥接口前缀；没有它的 runner 或 "
"sandbox manager 会拒绝启动。主机这套服务使用自己的 Compose 项目名；完整的本地环境根据 "
"`LOCAL_PROJECT_NAME` 推导。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SANDBOX_DOCKER`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Docker executable used by the host backend, default `docker`. With the "
"default, the runner and sandbox manager read container and network state "
"from the daemon's Engine API, on the socket `DOCKER_HOST` or the default "
"context names, instead of starting the executable for every read. Any "
"other executable keeps every Docker call on it."
msgstr ""
"主机后端使用的 Docker 可执行文件，默认 `docker`。使用默认值时，runner 和 sandbox manager 通过 "
"`DOCKER_HOST` 或默认 context 指定的 socket，从守护进程的 Engine API "
"读取容器和网络状态，而不是每次读取都启动可执行文件。换成其他可执行文件时，所有 Docker 调用都通过它进行。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SANDBOX_HOME`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Sandbox user home, default `/home/agent`."
msgstr "沙箱用户的主目录，默认 `/home/agent`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SANDBOX_UID` / `AGENT_SANDBOX_GID`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Sandbox non-root identity, defaults `10001` / `10001`."
msgstr "沙箱里非 root 用户的 UID 和 GID，默认 `10001` / `10001`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SANDBOX_EXTRA_ARGS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Additional Docker arguments parsed with `shlex.split`. Retained chats "
"reject unsafe options; this is trusted deployment configuration, never "
"job input."
msgstr "额外的 Docker 参数，用 `shlex.split` 解析。保留对话会拒绝不安全的选项；这是受信任的部署配置，绝不是任务能提供的输入。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_MEMBER_PROCESS_REAPER_SOURCE`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Internal.* Runner-side path to the root-owned `member-process-reaper` "
"helper, copied into a retained container created by an older compatible "
"image. The runner image supplies `/usr/local/libexec/member-process-"
"reaper`; operators normally never set it."
msgstr ""
"*内部使用*。runner 一侧属于 root 的 `member-process-reaper` "
"辅助程序的路径，会被复制进由较旧的兼容镜像创建的保留容器。runner 镜像提供 `/usr/local/libexec/member-"
"process-reaper`；运维人员通常无需设置。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_SANDBOX_ALLOW_UNISOLATED`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"**Isolation escape hatch.** It only opens the `process` backend, a non-"
"claimable test seam that can never serve a retained chat. It must be "
"unset in any environment untrusted repositories can reach."
msgstr ""
"**隔离的逃生口**。它只开放 `process` "
"后端，那是一个只供测试、不能认领工作的后端，永远不能服务保留对话。在不可信仓库可能接触到的任何环境中，都必须保持未设置。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_EGRESS_CHAT_NETWORK_POOL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Required.* This deployment's RFC1918 IPv4 pool; Docker allocates one "
"`/29` per active group bridge (a `/16` holds 8192). No default. It must "
"not overlap another deployment on the machine (the host rules refuse the "
"later of two overlapping pools) or any network the host already routes "
"(LAN, VPN, private services): preflight refuses such a pool, because a "
"bridge there would draw the host's own traffic. Idle and lost stops "
"remove a group's bridge at once; reconciliation removes stale bridges "
"from interrupted creates after five minutes."
msgstr ""
"*必需*。这个部署的 RFC1918 IPv4 地址池；Docker 为每个活跃的组网桥分配一个 `/29`（一个 `/16` 可容纳 8192 "
"个）。没有默认值。它不能与这台机器上的其他部署重叠（两个地址池重叠时，主机规则会拒绝后安装的那个），也不能与主机已经路由的任何网络重叠（局域网、VPN、私有服务）：预检会拒绝这样的地址池，因为在那里建网桥会把主机自己的流量吸过去。空闲停止和丢失停止会立即删除组的网桥；创建中断留下的陈旧网桥，由对账在五分钟后删除。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Required.* The one IPv4 resolver sandboxes may use, on TCP and UDP 53. "
"It is the only exception to the protected ranges, so a site resolver on a"
" private address, or on this host, works. Under runc Docker's embedded "
"resolver forwards to it; a Kata guest is given it in `/etc/resolv.conf` "
"by the trusted guest helper. Not loopback: a sandbox cannot reach the "
"host's `127.0.0.53`."
msgstr ""
"*必填。* 沙箱唯一能用的 IPv4 DNS 解析器，走 TCP 和 UDP 53 "
"端口。它是受保护地址段里唯一的例外，所以即使站点的解析器在私有地址上，或者就在本机上，也能用。在 runc 下，Docker "
"内置的解析器会转发给它；在 Kata guest 里，由受信任的 guest 辅助程序把它写进 "
"`/etc/resolv.conf`。不能是回环地址：沙箱访问不到主机的 `127.0.0.53`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_EGRESS_PROTECTED_CIDRS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Comma-separated IPv4 blocks sandboxes must not reach, on top of the "
"built-in host, private, link-local/metadata, CGNAT, multicast and "
"reserved ranges, for example an institution's services on public "
"addresses. It can only add protection. The control plane reads the same "
"variable when it checks an owner's SSH server, so set it there to the "
"hosts' value."
msgstr ""
"逗号分隔的 IPv4 "
"网段，在内置的主机、私有、链路本地/元数据、CGNAT、组播和保留地址范围之外，额外禁止沙箱访问，例如机构在公网地址上的服务。它只能增加保护。控制平面检查所有者的"
" SSH 服务器时也读取这个变量，所以在控制平面上也要设为与主机相同的值。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_RELAY_NETWORK`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"The route-less network the MCP relay is discovered on; no sandbox joins "
"it. Group lifecycle attaches the relay found here, under its alias, to "
"each group's bridge. The host stack derives `<COMPOSE_PROJECT>-agent-"
"relays`, so sibling stacks never find each other's relays; set it only to"
" name an existing network."
msgstr ""
"用来发现 MCP "
"中继的、不带路由的网络；任何沙箱都不会加入它。沙箱组的生命周期管理会把在这里找到的中继，以它的别名接入每个组的网桥。主机服务会自动得出 "
"`<COMPOSE_PROJECT>-agent-"
"relays`，所以同一台机器上的几套服务永远找不到彼此的中继；只有要指定一个已有的网络时，才需要设置它。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"~~`AGENT_EGRESS_SETUP_TIER`, `AGENT_EGRESS_AGENT_TIER`, "
"`AGENT_EGRESS_ALLOWLIST`, `AGENT_EGRESS_NETWORK_*`, "
"`AGENT_EGRESS_PROXY_*`, `AGENT_EGRESS_STOP_GRACE`, "
"`AGENT_SANDBOX_NETWORK`, `AGENT_SANDBOX_ALLOW_OPEN_NETWORK`~~"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Removed* with the network tiers and the Squid proxy: sandboxes have one "
"network ([design](docs/agents/specs/2026-09-23-agent-public-egress-design"
".zh-CN.md)). Nothing reads them; delete them from `.env`."
msgstr ""
"*已移除*，随网络分层和 Squid 代理一起去掉：沙箱只有一种网络（见[设计文档](docs/agents/specs/2026-09-23"
"-agent-public-egress-design.zh-CN.md)）。没有任何代码读取它们；请从 `.env` 中删除。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"`AGENT_COMPAT_CLIENT` / `AGENT_COMPAT_UPSTREAM_URL` / "
"`AGENT_COMPAT_UPSTREAM_KEY` / `AGENT_COMPAT_MODEL` / `AGENT_COMPAT_TOKEN`"
" / `AGENT_COMPAT_REASONING_EFFORT` / `AGENT_COMPAT_UPSTREAM_RELAY`"
msgstr ""
"`AGENT_COMPAT_CLIENT` / `AGENT_COMPAT_UPSTREAM_URL` / "
"`AGENT_COMPAT_UPSTREAM_KEY` / `AGENT_COMPAT_MODEL` / `AGENT_COMPAT_TOKEN`"
" / `AGENT_COMPAT_REASONING_EFFORT` / `AGENT_COMPAT_UPSTREAM_RELAY`"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"**Not operator-set.** What a host hands the protocol compatibility "
"launcher when Codex or Claude Code runs on a Chat Completions connection:"
" the CLI's protocol, the upstream URL and key, the model, the member's "
"loopback token from the claim, and the turn's reasoning level (sent "
"upstream as `reasoning_effort`, absent at Auto). "
"`AGENT_COMPAT_UPSTREAM_RELAY=1` marks the host's own model relay as the "
"upstream, for a provided model; only then is a plain `http` upstream "
"accepted, and the key is the member's placeholder. The launcher removes "
"all of them before it becomes the CLI, so the CLI never holds the "
"provider key."
msgstr ""
"**不由运维人员设置**。Codex 或 Claude Code 在 Chat Completions "
"连接上运行时，主机交给协议兼容启动器的值：CLI 的协议、上游 URL 和密钥、模型、来自认领的成员回环令牌，以及轮次的推理级别（作为 "
"`reasoning_effort` 发往上游，Auto 时不传）。`AGENT_COMPAT_UPSTREAM_RELAY=1` "
"表示上游是主机自己的模型中继，用于部署提供的模型；只有这时才接受普通 `http` 上游，密钥则是成员的占位凭据。启动器在变成 CLI "
"之前会移除所有这些值，所以 CLI 永远拿不到服务商密钥。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_LIVE_SESSION_ID` / `AGENT_LIVE_WORKDIR`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Internal.* Generated by the runtime adapter for the private "
"OpenCode/Kilo stdio bridge. Operators must not set these. They select the"
" already-authorized native session and fixed `/workspace` path inside one"
" member process; neither is a credential or host path."
msgstr ""
"*内部使用。* 由运行时适配器为私有的 OpenCode/Kilo stdio bridge "
"生成，运维人员不要设置。它们在单个成员进程里，指定已经授权的那个原生会话，以及固定的 `/workspace` "
"路径；两者都不是凭据，也不是主机路径。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_PLUGIN_PATHS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Internal.* Generated by the host plugin installer for pi, OpenCode, and "
"Kilo. A JSON array of absolute paths to the selected plugins installed in"
" the member's private home; defaults to `[]`. CLI wrappers load these "
"paths explicitly while retaining disabled project plugin discovery. "
"Operators must not set this; each chat's saved selections determine it."
msgstr ""
"*内部使用。* 由主机的插件安装程序为 pi、OpenCode 和 Kilo 生成。它是一个 JSON "
"数组，列出装在成员私有主目录里、被选中的插件的绝对路径，默认 `[]`。CLI "
"包装脚本会明确加载这些路径，同时保持项目插件的自动发现处于关闭状态。运维人员不要设置；它由每个对话保存的插件选择决定。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_ACTION_UID`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Internal.* Set by the sandbox manager on a repository environment action"
" it starts in a member's terminal: the scoped UID (31000–31063) the "
"action runs as. Operators must not set it."
msgstr ""
"*内部使用。* sandbox manager 在成员终端里启动一个仓库环境操作时设置，表示这个操作运行时使用的受限 "
"UID（31000–31063）。运维人员不要设置。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_ENVIRONMENT_SCRIPT` / `AGENT_SCRIPT_STATUS`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"*Internal.* Passed by the sandbox manager to the wrapper that runs one "
"repository environment script (`environment_process.py`): the script, and"
" where to record its exit status. The wrapper removes both from its "
"environment before the script starts. Operators must not set them."
msgstr ""
"*内部使用。* sandbox manager "
"传给运行单个仓库环境脚本的包装程序（`environment_process.py`）的两个值：要运行的脚本，以及把退出状态记在哪里。脚本开始运行之前，包装程序会把这两个值从环境里删掉。运维人员不要设置。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:645
msgid "Kata runtime qualification generation"
msgstr "Kata 运行时资格验证的代次"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:647
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The supported host deployment mounts `/var/lib/freeinference/kata-"
"runtime` read-only at `/run/agent-kata-runtime` in the runner. After a "
"verified install, its root-owned `epoch.json` holds `{ \"version\": 1, "
"\"state\": \"ready\", \"generation\": \"<UUID>\" }`. "
"`setup_kata_runtime.sh` takes a host-wide lock, publishes `updating` "
"before it changes the runtime, links or configuration, and publishes a "
"new ready generation only after installation and verification succeed. A "
"failed update stays `updating`; rerun the installer to repair it. "
"`--check` only verifies. Every deployment on the host sees the same "
"generation."
msgstr ""
"官方主机部署把 `/var/lib/freeinference/kata-runtime` 以只读方式挂载到 runner 的 `/run"
"/agent-kata-runtime`。安装并验证之后，其中属于 root 的 `epoch.json` 内容为 `{ \"version\":"
" 1, \"state\": \"ready\", \"generation\": \"<UUID>\" "
"}`。`setup_kata_runtime.sh` 会获取全主机范围的锁，在修改运行时、链接或配置之前发布 "
"`updating`，安装和验证都成功之后才发布新的 ready 代号。更新失败会停在 "
"`updating`；重新运行安装程序即可修复。`--check` 只做验证。同一台主机上的所有部署看到的是同一个代号。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:657
msgid ""
"On an existing host, deployment verifies Kata and creates only a missing "
"marker; it never replaces a generation or clears an incomplete update. A "
"missing epoch means full probes, and a malformed or `updating` one fails "
"closed. Change the runtime or its configuration only through the "
"supported installer, so every runner invalidates qualification before the"
" first changed file."
msgstr ""
"在已有的主机上，部署会验证 Kata，只在标记缺失时创建它；绝不替换已有代号，也不清除未完成的更新。缺少 epoch "
"意味着要做完整探测，格式错误或处于 `updating` 的 epoch 会以安全方式失败。只通过官方安装程序修改运行时或其配置，这样每个 "
"runner 都会在第一个文件被改动之前让资格判定失效。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:663
msgid "Complete local stack database recovery"
msgstr "完整本地环境的数据库恢复"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:665
msgid ""
"`deploy/local/dev.sh` keeps the local Postgres password and matching "
"`AGENT_DATABASE_URL` in the gitignored `deploy/local/.env.local`; back it"
" up with any retained local Docker volume. If the file is missing while "
"the Compose project still owns `agent-postgres`, the script refuses to "
"generate a new password: PostgreSQL applies `POSTGRES_PASSWORD` only when"
" it initializes an empty data directory, so a new value cannot unlock the"
" old volume. Restore the original `AGENT_POSTGRES_PASSWORD` and "
"`AGENT_DATABASE_URL`; the script never deletes the volume or resets its "
"password."
msgstr ""
"`deploy/local/dev.sh` 把本地 Postgres 密码和对应的 `AGENT_DATABASE_URL` 保存在被 "
"gitignore 的 `deploy/local/.env.local` 中；保留本地 Docker 卷时，要把这个文件一起备份。如果文件丢失而"
" Compose 项目仍拥有 `agent-postgres`，脚本会拒绝生成新密码：PostgreSQL 只在初始化空数据目录时应用 "
"`POSTGRES_PASSWORD`，新值打不开旧卷。请恢复原来的 `AGENT_POSTGRES_PASSWORD` 和 "
"`AGENT_DATABASE_URL`；脚本永远不会删除卷或重置其密码。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:674
msgid ""
"`up` builds the images first. `up` and `start` then start Postgres alone,"
" wait for it, check the DSN from the control-plane image and run Alembic "
"before starting the rest."
msgstr ""
"`up` 会先构建镜像。随后 `up` 和 `start` 先单独启动 Postgres，等它就绪，用控制平面镜像检查 DSN 并运行 "
"Alembic，然后才启动其余服务。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:678
msgid "Claude inference retry policy"
msgstr "Claude 推理请求的重试策略"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:680
msgid ""
"For each resident Claude Code process the runtime adapter sets "
"`CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_RETRIES=15` and `CLAUDE_CODE_RETRY_WATCHDOG=0`. These "
"are fixed launch settings, not host `.env` options. The CLI retries "
"transient inference errors with exponential backoff and jitter within the"
" native turn; `AGENT_TIMEOUT_S` still bounds the whole turn, and "
"exhaustion fails the turn but keeps its native context. See [Runtime "
"boundaries](docs/developer/operations.md#runtime-boundaries)."
msgstr ""
"运行时适配器为每个常驻的 Claude Code 进程设置 `CLAUDE_CODE_MAX_RETRIES=15` 和 "
"`CLAUDE_CODE_RETRY_WATCHDOG=0`。这是固定的启动设置，不是主机 `.env` 选项。CLI "
"在原生轮次内对临时性推理错误做带抖动的指数退避重试；整个轮次仍受 `AGENT_TIMEOUT_S` "
"限制，重试用尽时轮次失败，但保留其原生上下文。见[运行时边界](docs/developer/operations.md#runtime-"
"boundaries)。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:688
msgid "Agent CLI version pins (image build)"
msgstr "Agent CLI 的版本固定（构建镜像时）"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:690
msgid ""
"The five default versions are pinned in both `deploy/sandbox/Dockerfile"
".agent-sandbox` and `apps/backend/cloud_agent_shared/shared_protocol.py`."
" The image installs and labels them, and runners and the control plane "
"use the matching constants to decide whether `shared-sandbox-v1` may be "
"advertised or claimed, so they are source pins, not `.env` settings. "
"Change both together and rerun the agent-loop conformance suite. The "
"Dockerfile checks each exact version against the installed binary; a "
"dist-tag (`latest`) or range (`^2.1`) fails the build."
msgstr ""
"五个默认版本同时固定在 `deploy/sandbox/Dockerfile.agent-sandbox` 和 "
"`apps/backend/cloud_agent_shared/shared_protocol.py` "
"中。镜像安装这些版本并打上标签，runner 和控制平面用对应的常量判断能否声明或认领 `shared-"
"sandbox-v1`，所以它们是源码中的固定版本，不是 `.env` 设置。两处要一起改，并重新运行 agent "
"循环一致性测试。Dockerfile 会逐个核对安装的二进制文件是否为指定的确切版本；dist-"
"tag（`latest`）或版本范围（`^2.1`）会让构建失败。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:699
msgid ""
"**Updating an agent without a rebuild.** Claude Code, Codex, OpenCode and"
" pi can be updated from the admin Settings page (_Agent versions_ → "
"_Update to …_). Every host downloads that exact npm release into a local "
"image beside the sandbox image, checks it with one real turn against a "
"model on loopback, and reports progress on its heartbeat. Once every "
"online host holds it, new chats use it and existing chats keep their "
"version; _Roll back_ returns new chats to the previous one. Kilo runs "
"only its pin, a source build carrying a reviewed isolation patch. See the"
" [design](docs/agents/specs/2026-10-15-agent-cli-updates-design.zh-"
"CN.md)."
msgstr ""
"**不重新构建也能更新 agent**。Claude Code、Codex、OpenCode 和 pi 可以在管理页面的 Settings "
"中更新（_Agent versions_ → _Update to …_）。每台主机把这个确切的 npm "
"版本下载到沙箱镜像旁的一个本地镜像中，用一个针对回环地址上模型的真实轮次检查它，并在心跳中报告进度。所有在线主机都具备之后，新对话就使用它，已有对话保持原版本；_Roll"
" back_ 让新对话回到之前的版本。Kilo "
"只运行固定版本，那是一个带有经过审查的隔离补丁的源码构建。见[设计文档](docs/agents/specs/2026-10-15-agent-"
"cli-updates-design.zh-CN.md)。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Host side of the control-plane row above: the registry a host uses before"
" its first heartbeat answer. Default `https://registry.npmjs.org`."
msgstr ""
"对应上文控制平面那一行的主机侧：主机在收到第一次心跳应答之前使用的 registry。默认 "
"`https://registry.npmjs.org`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_RUNTIME_DOWNLOAD_NETWORK`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"The Docker network the download step runs on. Default `bridge`. Only npm "
"runs there, with install scripts disabled; the packages' own scripts and "
"the check run later with no network. Name another network only when the "
"host's default bridge cannot reach the registry."
msgstr ""
"下载这一步运行在哪个 Docker 网络上，默认 `bridge`。那里只运行 "
"npm，并且禁用了安装脚本；软件包自己的脚本和检查，之后在没有网络的环境里运行。只有主机默认的网桥访问不到 npm 仓库时，才需要指定别的网络。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:714
msgid ""
"Changing a pin claims that the new version's event stream still fits its "
"adapter in `cloud_agent_host/runtimes/`. "
"`tests/external/test_runtime_stream_conformance.py` tests that claim for "
"`claude-code` only; the other four runtimes have contract fixtures and "
"adapter unit tests, so their pin changes need careful review. The suite "
"reads the candidate from the Dockerfile's `ARG` line and runs that exact "
"version with `npx` against a fake model provider, so **put the version on"
" the `ARG` line** first:"
msgstr ""
"修改固定版本，等于声明新版本的事件流仍与 `cloud_agent_host/runtimes/` "
"中的适配器兼容。`tests/external/test_runtime_stream_conformance.py` 只为 `claude-"
"code` 检验这一点；另外四个运行时只有契约测试数据和适配器单元测试，所以修改它们的固定版本需要仔细审查。这套测试从 Dockerfile 的 "
"`ARG` 行读取候选版本，用 `npx` 针对一个模拟的模型服务商运行这个确切版本，所以先**把版本写到 `ARG` 行上**："

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:730
msgid ""
"A pass shows that the normalizer understands the version's events. It "
"does not exercise the deployed image, the sandbox or the dropdown."
msgstr "通过只说明规整程序能理解这个版本的事件。它不会测试已部署的镜像、沙箱或下拉菜单。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:733
msgid "Web (`apps/frontend/`)"
msgstr "Web（`apps/frontend/`）"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:735
msgid ""
"Frontend configuration is public and may not contain secrets. Build-time "
"routing settings are baked into the bundle and need a rebuild. Appearance"
" is saved in Admin → Settings and read by the web server per request. "
"Deployment time and release identity are runtime metadata."
msgstr ""
"前端配置是公开的，不能包含 secret。构建时的路由设置会打包进 bundle，修改需要重新构建。外观设置保存在 Admin → "
"Settings 中，Web 服务器每次请求时读取。部署时间和版本标识是运行时元数据。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:740
msgid "Build-time: the image variant"
msgstr "构建时决定：镜像变体"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:742
msgid ""
"A `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` variable is substituted into the bundle at `next "
"build`, so it must be an `ARG` in `deploy/control-plane/Dockerfile.web` "
"*and* a key under the `web` service's `build.args`; "
"`test_web_build_arguments_are_wired` fails otherwise. Changing one means "
"a rebuild."
msgstr ""
"`NEXT_PUBLIC_*` 变量在 `next build` 时替换进 bundle，所以它必须既是 `deploy/control-"
"plane/Dockerfile.web` 中的 `ARG`，*又*是 `web` 服务 `build.args` 下的键，否则 "
"`test_web_build_arguments_are_wired` 会失败。修改它就要重新构建。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:747
msgid ""
"The web app is served at the root of its own hostname and calls the "
"control plane at `/api` on the same origin, which the edge routes. Path-"
"prefix mounting is not supported: `deploy.sh` and the release deployer "
"refuse a leftover `AGENT_WEB_BASE_PATH`. The build rejects a relative API"
" value other than `/api`; an absolute URL is accepted for cross-origin "
"routing."
msgstr ""
"Web 应用部署在自己主机名的根路径下，通过同源的 `/api` 调用控制平面，由边缘代理负责路由。不支持挂载在路径前缀下：`deploy.sh`"
" 和发布部署程序会拒绝遗留的 `AGENT_WEB_BASE_PATH`。构建会拒绝 `/api` 以外的相对 API 地址；跨源路由可以使用绝对"
" URL。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Compose build argument"
msgstr "Compose 构建参数"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`NEXT_PUBLIC_AGENT_API_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Set to `/api`"
msgstr "固定为 `/api`"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Browser API base, fixed at `/api` on the same origin. A build that needs "
"a cross-origin control plane passes an absolute URL, which needs control-"
"plane CORS with credentials because authentication uses a session cookie."
msgstr ""
"浏览器访问 API 的基础路径，固定为同源的 `/api`。如果构建需要跨源访问控制平面，就传一个绝对 URL；因为认证靠会话 "
"cookie，这时控制平面要配置允许携带凭据的 CORS。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`NEXT_PUBLIC_BUILD_SHA`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`BUILD_SHA`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Optional build identity, baked in by the deploy script."
msgstr "可选的构建版本信息，由部署脚本写入。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`NEXT_PUBLIC_BUILD_TIMESTAMP`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`BUILD_TIMESTAMP`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Optional build identity."
msgstr "可选的构建版本信息。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:759
msgid "Runtime: the deployment's identity"
msgstr "运行时决定：部署的身份信息"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:761
msgid ""
"The main control plane imports the first six variables below into Admin →"
" Settings when it first initializes its settings: set them before the "
"first start, then change them in Admin. The web server reads the saved "
"values on every request through `GET /v1/agent/site-config`, so one image"
" serves any deployment. A web server without `AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_URL` "
"reads them from its own environment, for standalone development."
msgstr ""
"主控制平面首次初始化设置时，会把下面前六个变量导入 Admin → Settings：在第一次启动前设置好，之后在 Admin 中修改。Web "
"服务器每次请求时通过 `GET /v1/agent/site-config` 读取已保存的值，所以同一个镜像可以服务任何部署。没有 "
"`AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_URL` 的 Web 服务器从自己的环境变量读取这些值，用于独立开发。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_WEB_APP_NAME`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Product name in the header and the document title. Empty shows `Cloud "
"Agent`."
msgstr "页头和页面标题里的产品名。留空就显示 `Cloud Agent`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_WEB_ORG_NAME`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Optional organisation name beside the product name. Empty hides it."
msgstr "可选，显示在产品名旁边的组织名称。留空就不显示。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_WEB_ORG_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Link target for `AGENT_WEB_ORG_NAME`."
msgstr "`AGENT_WEB_ORG_NAME` 点击后跳转的地址。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_WEB_STATUS_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Status page, opened in a new tab from the header. Empty hides the link."
msgstr "状态页，从页头在新标签页中打开。留空则隐藏链接。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_WEB_DOCS_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"The deployment's user documentation, opened in a new tab from Help in the"
" account menu and from the My Settings page. Empty hides the link."
msgstr "本部署的用户文档，从账号菜单的 Help 和 My Settings 页面在新标签页中打开。留空则隐藏链接。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_WEB_CONTACT_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Where users reach the deployment's operators: an http(s) support page, or"
" `mailto:` and a single address (no `?subject=` or other fields). Shown "
"as Contact us under Help in the account menu. Empty hides the link."
msgstr ""
"用户联系这套部署的运维人员的方式：一个 http(s) 支持页面，或者 `mailto:` 加一个邮箱地址（不能带 `?subject=` "
"或其他参数）。显示在账号菜单 Help 下的 Contact us。留空就不显示这个链接。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`AGENT_WEB_DEPLOYED_AT`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"ISO timestamp with a timezone for the deployment footer. The control-"
"plane deploy script sets the activation time in UTC and records it in "
"`.deployed-at` after successful health checks; redeploying the same "
"release keeps it. When starting Compose by hand, supply the real "
"deployment time. Empty shows `Not available`."
msgstr ""
"页脚显示的部署时间，带时区的 ISO 时间戳。控制平面部署脚本在健康检查通过后把激活时间以 UTC 设置，并记录在 `.deployed-at` "
"中；重新部署同一个版本时保持不变。手动启动 Compose 时，请提供真实的部署时间。留空时显示 `Not available`。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:778
msgid ""
"The web service also receives `AGENT_DEPLOYMENT_SHA` for the footer, "
"which shows the first seven characters with the full commit in a tooltip."
" Saved URLs and booleans are validated before an admin update is "
"committed; the standalone fallback validates them when rendering."
msgstr ""
"Web 服务还会收到 `AGENT_DEPLOYMENT_SHA`，用于页脚：显示 commit 的前七个字符，完整的 commit "
"在提示框中。已保存的 URL 和布尔值在管理员的更新提交前校验；独立模式的回退在渲染时校验。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:783
msgid "Site content files"
msgstr "站点内容文件"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:785
msgid ""
"A deployment's Terms of Service, Team page and source link are files in "
"the deployment's own repository, not environment variables or Admin "
"settings, so a change is reviewed there and goes live with the next "
"deployment. Copy the directory to the control-plane host and point "
"`AGENT_SITE_CONTENT_DIR` at it. The control plane picks up a changed file"
" on the next request, without a restart. Every file is optional:"
msgstr ""
"部署的服务条款、Team 页和源码链接是放在部署自己仓库里的文件，不是环境变量，也不是 Admin "
"设置，所以改动在那个仓库里审查，随下一次部署上线。把这个目录复制到控制平面所在的主机，再让 `AGENT_SITE_CONTENT_DIR` "
"指向它。文件改动后，控制平面在下一个请求时就会读到，不需要重启。每个文件都是可选的："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "File"
msgstr "文件"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "Contents"
msgstr "内容"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`terms.en.txt`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"Terms of Service in English, plain UTF-8 text; blank lines separate "
"paragraphs."
msgstr "英文服务条款，UTF-8 纯文本；空行分段。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`terms.zh-CN.txt`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid ""
"The same in Simplified Chinese. `/terms` shows the reader's language, "
"else English."
msgstr "简体中文版。`/terms` 按读者的语言显示，没有对应语言时显示英文。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`site.yaml`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/configuration.md:1
msgid "`source_url`, the GitHub link in the footer, and `members`, the Team page."
msgstr "`source_url` 是页脚的 GitHub 链接，`members` 是 Team 页的成员。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:798
msgid ""
"Any Terms file replaces the `AGENT_LOCAL_TERMS_URL` and "
"`AGENT_LOCAL_TERMS_TEXT` settings, which Admin then shows read-only. "
"Without `site.yaml` the footer hides the Team and GitHub links."
msgstr ""
"只要有任何一个条款文件，`AGENT_LOCAL_TERMS_URL` 和 `AGENT_LOCAL_TERMS_TEXT` "
"这两项设置就以文件为准，Admin 里显示为只读。没有 `site.yaml` 时，页脚不显示 Team 和 GitHub 链接。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:813
msgid ""
"A label is either text or a mapping of `en` and `zh-CN` to text. URLs "
"must be absolute http(s). An unknown key, an invalid value or a file over"
" 256 KiB is logged as `site_content_ignored` and the file is treated as "
"absent, so check the files before deploying them."
msgstr ""
"标签可以是一段文本，也可以是 `en`、`zh-CN` 到文本的映射。URL 必须是绝对的 http(s) 地址。遇到未知的键、无效的值或超过 "
"256 KiB 的文件，会记一条 `site_content_ignored` 日志，并把这个文件当作不存在，所以部署前要先检查这些文件。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:818
msgid "Infrastructure (not environment variables)"
msgstr "基础设施（不是环境变量）"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:820
msgid "Decide these per deployment; record the answers in the private overlay."
msgstr "这些需要每个部署自行决定；把结论记录在私有 overlay 中。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:822
msgid ""
"**Domains**: one host for the web app and the control-plane API, the API "
"under `/api`, for example `agents.example.org` and a staging sibling. The"
" names go in `AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL` and `AGENT_PUBLIC_API_URL`."
msgstr ""
"**域名**：Web 应用和控制平面 API 共用一个主机名，API 在 `/api` 下，例如 `agents.example.org` "
"和对应的预发布域名。这些名称填进 `AGENT_WEB_BASE_URL` 和 `AGENT_PUBLIC_API_URL`。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:825
msgid ""
"**What a sandbox reaches**: its MCP relay, the resolver in "
"`AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER` and public IPv4 on TCP 80/443, the same during "
"setup and the agent run. Model calls go to each owner's provider over "
"that public HTTPS; tool calls stay on the MCP-only listener. A sandbox "
"holds its owner's provider key for the turn it runs; that exposure is "
"[accepted](docs/agents/specs/2026-09-23-agent-public-egress-design.zh-"
"CN.md) and limited to the owner's own key and quota."
msgstr ""
"**沙箱能访问什么**：它的 MCP 中继、`AGENT_EGRESS_DNS_SERVER` 指定的解析器，以及 TCP 80/443 上的公网"
" IPv4，环境准备和 agent 运行期间都一样。模型调用通过这条公网 HTTPS 发往各所有者的服务商；工具调用只走仅 MCP "
"监听进程。沙箱在运行轮次期间持有所有者的服务商密钥；这种暴露是[已接受的](docs/agents/specs/2026-09-23-agent-"
"public-egress-design.zh-CN.md)，范围仅限所有者自己的密钥和额度。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:832
msgid "**Sandbox image registry**: where hosts pull `AGENT_SANDBOX_IMAGE` from."
msgstr "**沙箱镜像 registry**：主机从哪里拉取 `AGENT_SANDBOX_IMAGE`。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:834
msgid "Adding a variable"
msgstr "新增变量时"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:836
msgid "Add a row here, in the right section, marked NEW."
msgstr "在本页合适的小节中添加一行，并标记 NEW。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:837
msgid "Say who provisions it and whether it differs per environment."
msgstr "说明由谁提供，以及不同环境的取值是否不同。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:838
msgid "For a secret, say where it is stored, never the value."
msgstr "如果是 secret，写明它存放在哪里，绝不写值本身。"

#: ../../ENVIRONMENT.md:839
msgid ""
"Classify it in `tests/support/env_inventory.py`. "
"`tests/unit/test_environment_inventory.py` and "
"`tests/unit/test_env_classification.py` fail on a variable the code reads"
" without a row here or an entry there."
msgstr ""
"在 `tests/support/env_inventory.py` "
"中为它分类。代码读取的变量如果在本页没有对应行，或在那里没有条目，`tests/unit/test_environment_inventory.py`"
" 和 `tests/unit/test_env_classification.py` 就会失败。"

